msgstr "PTXprint: Importim ol Seting..."

#: temp.glade:6876
msgid "RESET"
msgstr "RISET"

#: temp.glade:6881
msgid "Warning!\n"
"This will reset ALL the UI settings \n"
"for the CURRENT configuration to\n"
"their default values.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it will NOT reset the Style \n"
"settings stored in the .sty files.\n"
"\n"
"The reset is not saved until you next\n"
"save, print, or import with OK."
msgstr "Warning!\n"
"Dispela bai i bekim OLGETA UI seting \n"
"bilong configuration NAU long\n"
"standet velyu bilong ol.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim, em i NO BAI bekim ol Style \n"
"seting i stap long ol .sty fail.\n"
"\n"
"Bekim i no seivim inap yu seivim,\n"
"printim, o importim wantaim OK."

#: temp.glade:6985
msgid "PDF file (with embedded settings) or ZIP archive file"
msgstr "PDF fail (wantaim ol seting i stap insait) o ZIP archive fail"

#: temp.glade:6990
msgid "It is possible to import settings from an\n"
"existing PDF file which was produced earlier\n"
"by PTXprint. But this only works if the settings\n"
"are embedded within the PDF. (This is enabled\n"
"on the Finishing tab).\n"
"\n"
"Importing from a PTXprint ZIP archive \n"
"(created on the Help tab) is also possible."
msgstr "Yu ken importim ol seting long wanpela PDF fail PTXprint i bin wokim bipo. Tasol dispela i wok sapos ol seting i stap insait long PDF. (Yu ken oninim dispela long Finishing tab).\n"
"\n"
"Yu ken tu importim long wanpela PTXprint ZIP archive (ol i wokim long Help tab)."

#: temp.glade:7014
