msgstr "Makim project we yu laik importim\n"
"ol seting long en."

#: temp.glade:7066 temp.glade:7102
msgid "Select a configuration from the\n"
"selected project from which the\n"
"settings will be imported."
msgstr "Makim wanpela configuration bilong project\n"
"yu makim pinis, we yu laik importim\n"
"ol seting long en."

#: temp.glade:7074
msgid "(None)"
msgstr "(Nogat)"

#: temp.glade:7090 temp.glade:7278
msgid "Project:"
msgstr "Project:"

#: temp.glade:7107 temp.glade:7295
msgid "Configuration:"
msgstr "Konfigurasen:"

#: temp.glade:7134 temp.glade:7323 temp.glade:12182 temp.glade:24122 temp.glade:31663 temp.glade:31901 temp.glade:32145 temp.glade:32318 temp.glade:34925 temp.glade:36902 temp.glade:37631 temp.glade:38623 temp.glade:39278
msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Makim..."

#: temp.glade:7139
msgid "Select either a PTXprint PDF or ZIP archive\n"
"to import the settings from.\n"
"\n"
"Importing from a PDF will only work if the\n"
"PDF contains the PTXprint configuration\n"
"settings (as enabled on the Finishing tab)."
msgstr "Makim wanpela PTXprint PDF o ZIP archive\n"
"long kisim ol seting long en.\n"
"\n"
"Kisim ol seting long PDF inap wok sapos\n"
"PDF i gat ol PTXprint konfigurasen seting\n"
"(olsem yu makim long Finishing tab)."

#: temp.glade:7163
msgid "Source of Settings"
msgstr "Hap bilong kisim ol Seting"

#: temp.glade:7198
msgid "An External Folder of Settings"
msgstr "Wanpela Folder i Stap Autsait bilong ol Seting"

#: temp.glade:7203
msgid "Settings can be extracted to an external folder.\n"
"\n"
"This may be useful when examining settings from\n"
"a different user, or when there is a need to recover\n"
"lost settings from a known good PDF or Zip archive."
msgstr "Yu ken rausim ol seting i go long wanpela folder i stap autsait.\n"
"\n"
"Dispela inap helpim yu sapos yu laik lukim ol seting bilong narapela yusa, o sapos yu laik kisim bek ol seting i lus long wanpela gutpela PDF o Zip archive."

#: temp.glade:7223
msgid "A New/Existing Project and/or Configuration:"
msgstr "Wanpela Nupela/Olpela Project na/o Konfigurasen:"

#: temp.glade:7249
msgid "Select an existing project into which\n"
"the settings will be imported."
msgstr "Makim wanpela project i stap pinis we\n"
"ol seting bai i go insait long en."

#: temp.glade:7275
msgid "Select the project into which the\n"
"settings will be imported."
msgstr "Makim project we ol\n"
"seting bai i go insait long en."

#: temp.glade:7290
msgid "Select a configuration in the\n"
"selected project into which the\n"
"settings will be imported."
msgstr "Makim wanpela configuration long\n"
"project yu makim pinis we ol\n"
"seting bai i go insait long en."

#: temp.glade:7328
msgid "Select a folder to save the settings in.\n"
"This could be in a temporary location\n"
"from where just the needed settings\n"
"can be accessed and copied into the\n"
"appropriate place of an existing config."
msgstr "Makim wanpela folder bilong seivim ol seting long en.\n"
"Dispela inap i stap long wanpela hap bilong sotpela taim,\n"
"na yu ken kisim na kopiim ol seting yu nidim tasol\n"
"i go long stretpela hap bilong wanpela olpela konfigurasen."

#: temp.glade:7348
msgid "Choose a configuration from the\n"
"selected project into which the\n"
"settings will be imported.\n"
"  OR\n"
"Enter a NEW config name which\n"
"causes a new configuration to be\n"
"created for the current/new project."
msgstr "Makim wanpela konfigurasen bilong dispela\n"
"project yu makim pinis, na ol seting bai i go insait long en.\n"
"  O\n"
"Raitim wanpela NUPELA nem bilong konfigurasen\n"
"na bai wanpela nupela konfigurasen i kamap\n"
"long dispela nau/nupela project."

#: temp.glade:7366
msgid "Enter a name for the configuration to be saved.\n"
"\n"
"Note that only Roman/Latin names\n"
"are supported using: a-z A-Z, 0-9,\n"
"parentheses, underscores and hyphens."
msgstr "Putim wanpela nem bilong configuration yu laik seivim.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim, ol Roman/Latin nem tasol\n"
"i ken: a-z A-Z, 0-9,\n"
"parentesis, underscore na hyphen."

#: temp.glade:7390
msgid "Target"
msgstr "Taget"

#: temp.glade:7428
msgid "Import Entire PicList \"as is\" (overwrite existing PicList)"
msgstr "Kisim olgeta PicList \"olsem em i stap\" (karamapim olpela PicList)"

#: temp.glade:7432
msgid "Replace the target's whole picture list with\n"
"the source's. Pictures only in the target are\n"
"removed. Use it when the source is the master list."
msgstr "Senisim olgeta piksa lista bilong target wantaim\n"
"bilong source. Ol piksa i stap long target tasol\n"
"bai i go lus. Usim taim source i master lista."

#: temp.glade:7450
msgid "Import Elements of PicList (preserving existing PicList)"
msgstr "Kisim ol hap bilong PicList (holim olpela PicList)"

#: temp.glade:7454
msgid "Keep the target's picture list and copy only the\n"
"parts ticked below, for pictures in both lists."
msgstr "Holim piksa lista bilong target na kopiim ol\n"
"part yu tikim daunbilo tasol, long ol piksa i stap long tupela lista."

#: temp.glade:7480
msgid "Captions"
msgstr "Ol Kepsen"

#: temp.glade:7483
msgid "Copy the captions and the reference shown with\n"
"each picture. Leave unticked if the target is in\n"
"another language."
msgstr "Kopiim ol caption na reference i stap\n"
"wantaim wanwan piksa. No ken tikim sapos target i\n"
"long narapela tokples."

#: temp.glade:7498
msgid "Size, Position, Mirror, Rotation settings"
msgstr "Ol seting bilong Bikpela, Ples, Mirror, Rotesen"

#: temp.glade:7501
msgid "Copy the size, position, scale, mirroring\n"
"and rotation of each picture."
msgstr "Kopiim sais, ples, scale, mirror\n"
"na rotation bilong wanwan piksa."

#: temp.glade:7516
msgid "Copyright Information"
msgstr "Infomesen bilong Kopirait"

#: temp.glade:7519
msgid "Copy the copyright (credit) information\n"
"of each picture."
msgstr "Kopiim infomesen bilong kopirait (kredit)\n"
"bilong olgeta piksa."

#: temp.glade:7596
msgid "How to handle differences:"
msgstr "Olsem wanem long ol samting i narapela:"

#: temp.glade:7606
msgid "Add Any New Pictures"
msgstr "Putim Ol Nupela Piksa"

#: temp.glade:7609
msgid "Add pictures that are in the source list\n"
"but not yet in the target list."
msgstr "Putim ol piksa i stap long sol lista\n"
"but i no stap yet long target lista."

#: temp.glade:7625
msgid "Remove Any Old Pictures"
msgstr "Rausim Ol Olpela Piksa"

#: temp.glade:7628
msgid "Remove pictures from the target list that are\n"
"not in the source list. Tick it when the source\n"
"list is the complete, final list."
msgstr "Rausim ol piksa long target lista i no stap\n"
"long sol lista. Makim dispela sapos sol\n"
"lista em i pinis lista, i no inap senis moa."

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:3048
msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "Ol Piksa"

#: temp.glade:7657
msgid "Import the picture settings and the\n"
"picture list. Use the Pictures tab\n"
"of this dialog to choose how the\n"
"picture list is combined."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong piksa na\n"
"lista bilong piksa. Yusim Pictures tab\n"
"bilong dispela dialog long makim olsem wanem\n"
"lista bilong piksa i bung."

#: temp.glade:7689
msgid "Enabling this option will import (overwrite) the page size, \n"
"column-layout, margins and related settings. (Header and footer settings\n"
"are imported with Other > Header+Footer settings.)"
msgstr "Sapos yu opim dispela, em bai kisim (na karamapim) saiz bilong pes,\n"
"kolum-leiaut, margin na ol narapela seting i pas wantaim. (Ol seting bilong het na put i kamap wantaim Other > Header+Footer settings.)"

#: temp.glade:7707 temp.glade:19895
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Leiaut"

#: temp.glade:7711
msgid "Import page size, margins, columns,\n"
"line spacing and related settings."
msgstr "Kisim saiz bilong pes, margin, kolum,\n"
"spes bilong lain na ol narapela seting i pas wantaim."

#: temp.glade:7741
msgid "Enabling this option will import the main font and script settings (Fonts+Scripts tab), including text direction, line breaking and spacing.\n"
"Fonts that have been set within individual Styles are also updated to match the source. (Hyphenation settings are imported with Other > Body Tab settings.)"
msgstr "Sapos yu opim dispela, em bai kisim ol seting bilong main font na skript (Fonts+Scripts tab), wantaim direksen bilong tok, brekim lain na spes.\n"
"Ol font i stap insait long ol wanwan Style tu bai senis long wankain olsem sol. (Ol seting bilong hyphenation i kam wantaim Other > Body Tab settings.)"

#: temp.glade:7758 temp.glade:20993
msgid "Fonts+Script"
msgstr "Fonts+Script"

#: temp.glade:7762
msgid "Import the font and script settings (Fonts+Scripts tab),\n"
"including fonts set within individual styles."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong font na skript (Fonts+Scripts tab),\n"
"wantaim ol font i stap insait long ol wanwan style."

#: temp.glade:7792
msgid "This will selectively import any Styles which are different from the Default settings.\n"
"Styles from ptxprint-mods.sty are imported with Other > Advanced settings (custom.sty is never imported).\n"
"Fonts set within styles are only imported if Fonts+Script is also ticked.\n"
"You may also want to RESET the current configuration (see below) before importing styles."
msgstr "Dispela bai kisim ol Style i narapela long Default seting.\n"
"Ol Style bilong ptxprint-mods.sty i kam wantaim Other > Advanced settings (custom.sty i no inap kam).\n"
"Ol font long insait long style i kam sapos Fonts+Script i gat mak tu.\n"
"Yu ken laik RESET kọnfigyuresen bilong nau (lukimastap daun) bipo yu kisim ol style."

#: temp.glade:7806
msgid "Override ALL Style Settings"
msgstr "Senisim OLGETA Seting bilong Stail"

#: temp.glade:7810
msgid "Normally only styles that have not been changed\n"
"in the receiving configuration will be imported.\n"
"But if you require ALL styles to be updated\n"
"regardless of whether they have already been\n"
"modified locally, then enable this option.\n"
"(This also applies to fonts in styles imported\n"
"with Fonts+Script.)"
msgstr "Olgeta taim ol style i no senis pinis\n"
"long kọnfigyuresen i kisim bai kam tasol.\n"
"Sapos yu laik olgeta style i senis\n"
"biknem ol i senis pinis long hia,\n"
"opim dispela seting.\n"
"(Dispela i wok long ol font long style\n"
"i kam wantaim Fonts+Script tu.)"

#: temp.glade:7836 temp.glade:34738
msgid "Styles"
msgstr "Ol Stail"

#: temp.glade:7840
msgid "Import the style settings (Styles tab),\n"
"merged into the target configuration."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong style (Styles tab),\n"
"na bungim wantaim target konfigyuresen."

#: temp.glade:7873
msgid "Other settings can be imported as needed:"
msgstr "Yu ken kisim ol narapela seting sapos yu nidim:"

#: temp.glade:7905
msgid "Body Tab settings"
msgstr "Ol seting bilong Body Tab"

#: temp.glade:7908
msgid "Import the settings of the Body tab."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong Body tab."

#: temp.glade:7922
msgid "Notes+Refs settings"
msgstr "Seting bilong Notes+Refs"

#: temp.glade:7925
msgid "Import the settings of the Notes+Refs tab."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong Notes+Refs tab."

#: temp.glade:7939
msgid "Header+Footer settings"
msgstr "Seting bilong Header+Footer"

#: temp.glade:7942
msgid "Import the settings of the\n"
"Header+Footer tab."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong\n"
"Header+Footer tab."

#: temp.glade:7957
msgid "Thumb Tabs settings"
msgstr "Seting bilong Thumb Tabs"

#: temp.glade:7960
msgid "Import the thumb tab settings\n"
"(Tabs+Borders tab)."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong thumb tab\n"
"(Tabs+Borders tab)."

#: temp.glade:7974
msgid "Overwrite Front Matter"
msgstr "Skrapim Front Matter"

#: temp.glade:7977
msgid "Replace the front matter in the target with\n"
"the source's, instead of only adding the\n"
"parts that are missing."
msgstr "Senisim front matter long target long\n"
"bilong sol, i no putim tasol ol hap\n"
"i no stap."

#: temp.glade:7992
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Seting bilong Advanced"

#: temp.glade:7996
msgid "This includes everything on the Advanced tab\n"
"with the exception of Custom Script processing\n"
"and Customized Styles (custom.sty)."
msgstr "Dispela i gat olgeta samting long Advanced tab\n"
"olsem tasol Custom Script processing\n"
"na Customized Styles (custom.sty) i no stap insait."

#: temp.glade:8022
msgid "Cover settings"
msgstr "Seting bilong Cover"

#: temp.glade:8025
msgid "Import the cover settings, cover styles\n"
"and the cover pages of the front matter."
msgstr "Kisim ol seting bilong kava, ol style bilong kava\n"
"na ol pes bilong kava bilong front matter."

#: temp.glade:8040
msgid "Front +Back Matter"
msgstr "Front +Back Matter"

#: temp.glade:8044
msgid "This includes most of the settings on\n"
"the Peripherals tab, but not the Variables\n"
"and Values. Front Matter and also Section\n"
"Introductions are included in this."
msgstr "Dispela i gat planti seting bilong\n"
"Peripherals tab, tasol i no gat Variables\n"
"na Values. Front Matter na Section\n"
"Introductions tu i stap insait long dispela."

#: temp.glade:8072
msgid "Custom Script"
msgstr "Custom Script"

#: temp.glade:8077
msgid "This includes the Custom Script processing\n"
"defined on the Advanced tab.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it is not possible to extract a\n"
"custom script from a PDF file, which is\n"
"why this option is sometimes disabled."
msgstr "Dispela i gat Custom Script processing\n"
"ol i makim long Advanced tab.\n"
"\n"
"Skelim: i no inap long kisim wanpela\n"
"custom script long PDF fail. Dispela\n"
"i as bilong wanem sampela taim\n"
"dispela opsen i no save wok."

#: temp.glade:8094
msgid "Borders + Decorations"
msgstr "Borders + Decorations"

#: temp.glade:8098
msgid "This includes the various decorative\n"
"borders and other ornamental features\n"
"including section headers, end-of-book\n"
"and verse number decorators."
msgstr "Dispela i gat ol narapela narapela\n"
"border bilong dekoresen na ol narapela\n"
"ornamental samting, wantaim ol section header,\n"
"end-of-book na ol dekoresen bilong namba bilong ves."

#: temp.glade:8113
msgid "Variables + Meta Data"
msgstr "Variables + Meta Data"

#: temp.glade:8116
msgid "Import the variables (Peripherals tab) and the\n"
"publication details: copyright statement,\n"
"licence, colophon and configuration notes.\n"
