msgstr "Top: Antap long olgeta samting except hed lain\n"
"Bottom: Aninit long olgeta ves tekst (na ol futnot long diglot)\n"
"Before Verse: 'Hia' we i makim o bipo long Anchor Ref bilong en\n"
"After Paragraph: Bihain long dispela paragraf\n"
"Cutout: Wanpela kona i katim long tekst, i stat long lain nau\n"
