"of settings that can be saved.\n"
"By naming and saving a layout\n"
"you can recall those settings later."
msgstr "Wanpela Layout (o Config) em i kolekson\n"
"bilong ol seting i ken seiv.\n"
"Sapos yu givim nem na seivim layout,\n"
"yu ken kisim bek ol dispela seting bihain."

#: temp.glade:17364
msgid "Layout Configuration"
msgstr "Layout Configuration"

#: temp.glade:17427
msgid "Select Multiple Books..."
msgstr "Makim Planti Buk..."

#: temp.glade:17432
msgid "Select one or more Biblical books\n"
"to be printed from the project."
msgstr "Makim wanpela o moa buk bilong Baibel\n"
"i go long project long printim."

#: temp.glade:17445
msgid "Bible Module:"
msgstr "Baibel Module:"

#: temp.glade:17449
msgid "Print a Paratext Bible module\n"
"(a .sfm file that lists the\n"
"passages to include)."
msgstr "Printim wanpela Paratext Bible module\n"
"(wanpela .sfm fail i lisim ol\n"
"hap long putim)."

#: temp.glade:17469
msgid "Portions or\n"
"Multiple Books:"
msgstr "Ol Hap o\n"
"Planti Buk:"

#: temp.glade:17475
msgid "Print several books, or the\n"
"passages listed in the box."
msgstr "Printim ol buk i winim wanpela, o ol\n"
"hap i lisim long boks."

#: temp.glade:17494
msgid "Single Book:"
msgstr "Wanpela Buk:"

#: temp.glade:17498
msgid "Print one book, or a range\n"
"of its chapters."
msgstr "Printim wanpela buk, o sampela\n"
"kapitel bilong en."

#: temp.glade:17540 temp.glade:17572
msgid "Use 3-letter USFM book codes (e.g. JHN, not John; MRK, not Mark).\n"
"\n"
"A list of references can be entered if printing less\n"
"than an entire book or chapter, or if you need to\n"
"include portions from several books. For example:\n"
"  JHN 2:1-12\n"
"  MRK 1-5\n"
"  PSA 23; 100; 117\n"
"  EXO 20:12-17 MAT 5:3-11\n"
"  GEN 1:1-2:3 PSA 23:1-end LUK 15:11-32 GLO\n"
"  GEN 24:1-17; 24:22-30\n"
"  MAT-REV\n"
"\n"
"If working on several books, use the Select Multiple\n"
"Books... button to select them. For example:\n"
"  LUK ACT GLO NDX\n"
"prints Luke, Acts, Glossary and Names Index.\n"
"The list is editable, so books can be re-ordered\n"
"if need be (for example, for the Hebrew canon).\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-B"
msgstr "Yusim 3-leta USFM kod bilong buk (olsem JHN, i no John; MRK, i no Mark).\n"
"\n"
"Yu ken putim wanpela lista bilong ol referens sapos yu printim\n"
"liklik winim olgeta buk o kapitel, o sapos yu laik\n"
"putim ol hap bilong sampela buk. Olsem:\n"
"  JHN 2:1-12\n"
"  MRK 1-5\n"
"  PSA 23; 100; 117\n"
"  EXO 20:12-17 MAT 5:3-11\n"
"  GEN 1:1-2:3 PSA 23:1-end LUK 15:11-32 GLO\n"
"  GEN 24:1-17; 24:22-30\n"
"  MAT-REV\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu wok long sampela buk, yusim Select Multiple\n"
"Books... boton long makim ol. Olsem:\n"
"  LUK ACT GLO NDX\n"
"i printim Luk, Aposel, Glossary na Names Index.\n"
"Yu ken senisim lista, olsem na yu ken senisim order\n"
"bilong ol buk sapos i nidim (olsem long Hebrew canon).\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-B"

#: temp.glade:17594
msgid "e.g. GEN 1:1-2:3 JHN 1:1-5    or    LUK ACT GLO    or    GEN EXO LEV NUM DEU"
msgstr "olsem GEN 1:1-2:3 JHN 1:1-5    o    LUK ACT GLO    o    GEN EXO LEV NUM DEU"

#: temp.glade:17621
msgid "From Chapter:"
msgstr "Long Kapitel:"

#: temp.glade:17633
msgid "If you want to print less than\n"
"the entire book, enter the\n"
"chapter number to start at."
msgstr "Sapos yu no laik printim olgeta\n"
"buk, putim namba bilong kapitel\n"
"yu laik stat long en."

#: temp.glade:17644
msgid "If you want to print less than \n"
"the entire book, enter the\n"
"chapter number to start at."
msgstr "Sapos yu laik printim liklik hap tasol\n"
"bilong buk, raitim namba bilong\n"
"kapitel bilong stat long en."

#: temp.glade:17647 temp.glade:38497 temp.glade:39014
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: temp.glade:17661
msgid "If you want to print less than\n"
"the entire book, enter the\n"
"chapter number to end with."
msgstr "Sapos yu no laik printim olgeta\n"
"buk, putim namba bilong kapitel\n"
"yu laik pinis long en."

#: temp.glade:17672
msgid "If you want to print less than \n"
"the entire book, enter the\n"
"chapter number to end with."
msgstr "Sapos yu laik printim liklik hap tasol\n"
"bilong buk, raitim namba bilong\n"
"kapitel bilong pinis long en."

#: temp.glade:17675
msgid "150"
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:17691
msgid "To:"
msgstr "Go long:"

#: temp.glade:17713
msgid "Choose..."
msgstr "Makim..."

#: temp.glade:17729 temp.glade:34979 temp.glade:35004 temp.glade:35027 temp.glade:35098 temp.glade:35121 temp.glade:35140 temp.glade:37252 temp.glade:37374
msgid "Edit..."
msgstr "Edit..."

#: temp.glade:17734
msgid "Switch to the View+Edit tab to\n"
"show the selected Bible module."
msgstr "Go long View+Edit tab long soim\n"
"Baibel module yu bin makim."

#: temp.glade:17794
msgid "What to Print"
msgstr "Wanem Bilong Printim"

#: temp.glade:17813
msgid "Select the Project and Book(s),\n"
"to be used to create the PDF file.\n"
"\n"
"You can also Save/Share\n"
"Configuration settings."
msgstr "Makim Project na Buk(s),\n"
"bilong kamapim PDF fail.\n"
"\n"
"Yu ken Seivim/Serim tu\n"
"seting bilong Configuration."

#: temp.glade:17819
msgid "Basic"
msgstr "Basic"

#: temp.glade:17865
msgid "Binding\n"
"Gutter (mm):"
msgstr "Gutter bilong\n"
"Baindim (mm):"

#: temp.glade:17871
msgid "This is the amount of space to be\n"
"given on the inner edge of each\n"
"page for binding (millimeters).\n"
"\n"
"However, if Outer Gutter is enabled\n"
"this extra space will appear on the\n"
"outside edge of each page. This can\n"
"be useful for a journaling layout."
msgstr "Dispela em hamas spes bilong\n"
"putim long insait sait bilong olgeta\n"
"pes bilong baindim (milimita).\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos Outer Gutter i op,\n"
"dispela extra spes bai i kamap long\n"
"autsait sait bilong olgeta pes. Dispela\n"
"i ken helpim long journaling layout."

#: temp.glade:17895
msgid "This amount is added to the ‘Side Margin\n"
"Width’ amount to the inner edge (or outside\n"
"edge, if you check ‘Outer Gutter’)."
msgstr "Dispela namba i joinim wantaim namba bilong ‘Side Margin\n"
"Width’ long insait sait (o autsait sait,\n"
"sapos yu makim ‘Outer Gutter’)."

#: temp.glade:17926
msgid "Base Line spacing in points (pts).\n"
"Change to increase or decrease\n"
"space between lines of text."
msgstr "Base Line spacing long points (pts).\n"
"Senisim bilong mekim spes namel long\n"
"ol line bilong tok i bikpela o liklik."

#: temp.glade:17958 temp.glade:17975
msgid "Type required page width and height,\n"
"     for example:    148mm, 208mm \n"
"or select from the list of preset values."
msgstr "Taipim wait na longpela bilong pes,\n"
"     olsem:    148mm, 208mm \n"
"o makim wanpela long lista bilong ol namba i stap pinis."

#: temp.glade:17963
msgid "Page Size:"
msgstr "Saiz bilong Pes:"

#: temp.glade:18020
msgid "Set the point size of the main body text."
msgstr "Makim point saiz bilong main tok."

#: temp.glade:18047
msgid "The amount by which paragraphs\n"
"should be indented (inches). This \n"
"also affects poetry indentation.\n"
"(default=1, min=0, max=4)"
msgstr "Hamas bilong ol paragraf\n"
"i mas go insait (inces). Dispela\n"
"i senisim indent bilong poetri tu.\n"
"(default=1, min=0, max=4)"

#: temp.glade:18076 temp.glade:18095
msgid "This is an approximate calculation of the\n"
"most number of lines that will fit on a page.\n"
"An exact count is difficult due to ascent\n"
"and descent values of the main body font."
msgstr "Dispela em wanpela kalkuleisen\n"
"bilong hamas line i ken pas long wanpela pes.\n"
"Hatwok long kisim stretpela namba bikos\n"
"ascent na descent valu bilong main font."

#: temp.glade:18083
msgid "99.9"
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:18101
msgid "Lines Per Page:"
msgstr "Ol Line long Wanpela Pes:"

#: temp.glade:18115
msgid "Fine Tune Line Spacing:\n"
"\n"
"This button is only active when PTXprint has a suggestion to\n"
"shrink or expand the line spacing slightly to minimise wasted \n"
"vertical space on the page. Click to accept the suggestion.\n"
"\n"
"If there is more than half a line of 'spare' space on the \n"
"page then the line-spacing will decrease slightly to\n"
"fit one more line of text on the page.\n"
"\n"
"If there is less than half a line of 'spare' space on the \n"
"page then the line-spacing will increase slightly to \n"
"fill the page more evenly (with the same number of \n"
"lines of text).\n"
"\n"
"If you prefer to keep the exact line spacing specified, \n"
"then do NOT click this option. Instead, use the similar\n"
"button to adjust either the Top or Bottom Margin.\n"
"\n"
"Note: if Lock Ratio is ticked, the font size\n"
"will also change slightly."
msgstr "Stretim Lain Spesing:\n"
"\n"
"Dispela boton i wok tasol taim PTXprint i gat tingting long\n"
"mekim lain spesing i liklik smol o bikpela liklik, bilong\n"
"no ken lusim spes nating long pes. Klikim long kisim dispela tingting.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat moa long hap lain 'spea' spes long\n"
"pes, orait lain spesing bai i go daun liklik\n"
"bilong wanpela lain moa i ken pas long pes.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat liklik long hap lain 'spea' spes long\n"
"pes, orait lain spesing bai i go antap liklik\n"
"bilong pulap gut moa long pes (wantaim sem namba\n"
"bilong lain).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik holim stret lain spesing yu makim pinis,\n"
"orait NO klikim dispela. Yusim narapela boton i olsem\n"
"bilong senisim Top o Bottom Margin.\n"
"\n"
"Not: sapos Lock Ratio i gat tik, sais bilong font\n"
"i senis liklik tu."

#: temp.glade:18149
msgid "Outer Gutter"
msgstr "Outer Gutter"

#: temp.glade:18154
msgid "An Outer Gutter can be used to create\n"
"additional whitespace (for notes etc.)\n"
"on the OUTER edge of each page as\n"
"commonly seen in a journaling layout."
msgstr "Outer Gutter i ken mekim\n"
"moa spes (bilong nots na ol narapela)\n"
"long AUTSAIT sait bilong olgeta pes\n"
"olsem yumi save lukim long journaling layout."

#: temp.glade:18170
msgid "Lock\n"
"Ratio"
msgstr "Pasim\n"
"Ratio"

#: temp.glade:18176
msgid "Lock the ratio of the Base Font Size\n"
"to the Base Line Spacing so that the\n"
"spacing grows/shrinks according to\n"
"the size of the font; or the font size\n"
"changes when the spacing changes."
msgstr "Pasim ratio bilong Base Font Size\n"
"na Base Line Spacing, olsem na\n"
"spes i go bikpela/liklik wantaim\n"
"saiz bilong font; o font saiz\n"
"i senis taim spes i senis."

#: temp.glade:18201
msgid "The space by which paragraphs\n"
"should be indented (inches). This \n"
"also affects poetry indentation.\n"
"Note that for a single-column text\n"
"this value needs to be higher than\n"
"for two-column texts, and the value\n"
"updates automatically when you change\n"
"from 1 to 2 columns, and vice versa. "
msgstr "Hamas bilong ol paragraf\n"
"i mas go insait (inces). Dispela\n"
"i senisim indent bilong poetri tu.\n"
"Harim: long wanpela-kolum tok,\n"
"dispela namba i mas bikpela moa\n"
"bilong tu-kolum tok, na namba\n"
"i senis yet taim yu senisim\n"
"wan i go long tu kolum, o tu i go long wan. "

#: temp.glade:18211
msgid "Base Indent:"
msgstr "Base Indent:"

#: temp.glade:18230
msgid "This is the base font size for default paragraph \n"
"text. All other font sizes are calculated (according \n"
"to their factor size) based on this value."
msgstr "Dispela em base font saiz bilong\n"
"normal paragraf tok. Olgeta narapela font saiz\n"
"i kalkuleitim (long faktor saiz bilong ol)\n"
"long dispela namba."

#: temp.glade:18235
msgid "Base Font\n"
"Size (pt):"
msgstr "Base Font\n"
"Saiz (pt):"

#: temp.glade:18255
msgid "This is the base line spacing \n"
"for default paragraph text."
msgstr "Dispela em base line spacing\n"
"bilong normal paragraf tok."

#: temp.glade:18259
msgid "Base Line\n"
"Spacing (pt):"
msgstr "Base Line\n"
"Spacing (pt):"

#: temp.glade:18284
msgid "For high quality typesetting it is\n"
"best practice to Align the Text\n"
"to the Baseline (i.e. on grid). This\n"
"ensures consistent line spacing\n"
"and front-to-back registration.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this may leave larger\n"
"empty spaces at the end of pages\n"
"which will need to be manually\n"
"adjusted using the Adjust List."
msgstr "Bilong gutpela typesetting, i gutpela\n"
"long Alainim Tok long Baseline\n"
"(i.e. on grid). Dispela i helpim\n"
"line spacing i sem na front-to-back\n"
"registration.\n"
"\n"
"Harim: dispela i ken lusim bikpela\n"
"open spes long las bilong ol pes,\n"
"na yu mas senisim long han\n"
"wantaim Adjust List."

#: temp.glade:18295
msgid "Align Text to Baseline"
msgstr "Alainim Tok long Baseline"

#: temp.glade:18308
msgid "For high quality typesetting it is\n"
"best practice to Align the Text\n"
"to the (baseline) Grid. This\n"
"ensures consistent line spacing\n"
"and front-to-back registration.\n"
"\n"
"However, for quick draft printouts\n"
"or typesetting for thicker paper,\n"
"Variable Line Spacing mode enables\n"
"vertical justification which fills \n"
"each column of text as needed to\n"
"use up the entire page.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This is a major 'mode' change.\n"
"Everything will shift as a result. Consider\n"
"carefully before changing this setting."
msgstr "Bilong gutpela typesetting, em i gutpela moa long Alainim Tekst long Grid (baseline). Dispela i mekim ol lain i stap stret na ol pes i stap wankain long baksait na pes bilong en.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos yu laik printim wanpela draft hariap o yusim pepa i fat, Variable Line Spacing i mekim tekst i pulap long olgeta kolum long pes.\n"
"\n"
"Wokim tingting: Dispela i bikpela senis bilong 'mode'. Olgeta samting bai senis. Tingting gut pastem yu senisim dispela seting."

#: temp.glade:18340
msgid "Allowing a small increase in the (vertical)\n"
"line spacing allows the text to stretch \n"
"vertically to fill the entire column.\n"
"\n"
"This will also enable 'Fill Columns', but you \n"
"can turn that off to see how much extra\n"
"space there is at the end of each column.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This will cause major changes to\n"
"the layout of the entire document. It will \n"
"also place headings exactly rather than \n"
"rounding to the nearest number of lines.\n"
"\n"
"Do NOT use this setting if doing final\n"
"typesetting for thin Bible paper as \n"
"front-to-back registration is not\n"
"enforced with Variable Line Spacing."
msgstr "Sapos yu larim lain spacing (long ap na daun) i kamap bikpela liklik, tekst i ken pulapim olgeta kolum.\n"
"\n"
"Dispela bai opim tu 'Fill Columns', tasol yu ken pasim long lukim hamas spes i stap long pinis bilong olgeta kolum.\n"
"\n"
"Wokim tingting: Dispela bai mekim bikpela senis long lei-aut bilong olgeta dokumen. Na tu, bai i putim ol heding stret, i no raun long nambawan lain i stap klostu.\n"
"\n"
"NO usim dispela seting sapos yu mekim las typesetting bilong pepa Baibel i thin, long wanem, Variable Line Spacing i no mekim ol pes i stap stret long baksait na pes bilong en."

#: temp.glade:18359
msgid "Variable Line Spacing"
msgstr "Variable Line Spacing"

#: temp.glade:18369
msgid "Fill Columns"
msgstr "Pulapim Kolum"

#: temp.glade:18374
msgid "A small increase in the (vertical)\n"
"line spacing allows the text to\n"
"stretch to fill the entire column.\n"
"\n"
"This is called vertical justification\n"
"and is useful for Draft Printouts\n"
"where the page can be filled\n"
"without manual intervention to \n"
"eliminate unwanted gaps at the \n"
"end of columns. The setting \n"
"'Allow Unbalanced Columns' \n"
"automatically gets enabled when\n"
"you choose this setting."
msgstr "Sapos lain spacing (long ap na daun) i kamap bikpela liklik, tekst i ken pulapim olgeta kolum.\n"
"\n"
"Dispela ol i kolim vertical justification na i helpim ol Draft Printout, long wanem pes i ken pulap na i no gat ol spes i no gutpela long pinis bilong ol kolum, na yu no ken mekim wok long han. Seting 'Allow Unbalanced Columns' bai opim yet taim yu makim dispela seting."

#: temp.glade:18423
msgid "Notelines"
msgstr "Notelines"

#: temp.glade:18427
msgid "Include ruled margins to provide space\n"
"for personal notes, reflections, and artwork.\n"
"Typically called 'Journaling Bibles' or\n"
"'Wide-Margin Bibles'.\n"
"\n"
"Hint: Set the Binding Gutter to a larger value\n"
"(>40mm) and enable Outer Gutter. Other\n"
"settings to control the appearance and spacing\n"
"of the Notelines are in the 'Page Layout and\n"
"Spacing' section of the Advanced > Other tab."
msgstr "Putim ol margin i gat lain bilong givim spes\n"
"bilong ol nots bilong yu yet, ol tingting, na piksa.\n"
"Ol i save kolim 'Journaling Bibles' o\n"
"'Wide-Margin Bibles'.\n"
"\n"
"Hin: Setim Binding Gutter long bikpela namba\n"
"(>40mm) na opim Outer Gutter. Ol narapela\n"
"seting bilong kontrolim Notelines i stap long\n"
"'Page Layout and Spacing' long Advanced > Other tab."

#: temp.glade:18454
msgid "Set the color of the Notelines."
msgstr "Makim kala bilong ol Notelines."

#: temp.glade:18467
msgid "Mirror Pages"
msgstr "Mirror Pages"

#: temp.glade:18472
msgid "Mirror Pages makes use of an Inner+Outer layout.\n"
"This will make the left page header the inner header and\n"
"the right page header will be shown on the outer edge\n"
"(i.e. headers on odd and even pages are mirrored).\n"
"\n"
"Behaviour for Diglots:\n"
"Note that when creating a Diglot, this will place the\n"
"primary text as the Inner text (closest to the spine),\n"
"and the secondary text as the Outer text (closest to\n"
"the edge of the page).\n"
"\n"
"If you always want the Primary text on the left and\n"
"Secondary text on the right regardless of whether\n"
"it is an odd or even page, then turn off this option."
msgstr "Mirror Pages i usim lei-aut bilong Inner+Outer.\n"
"Heda bilong pes i stap long ``left`` bai kamap heda bilong insait, na heda bilong pes long ``right`` bai kamap long arasait (i min, ol heda long ol pes i gat odd na even nambawan i olsem mirror).\n"
"\n"
"Sindaun bilong Diglot:\n"
"Sapos yu mekim Diglot, dispela bai putim tekst nambawan olsem tekst bilong insait (klostu long spine), na tekst namba tu olsem tekst bilong arasait (klostu long hed bilong pes).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik putim tekst nambawan long left na tekst namba tu long right oltaim, maski pes i odd o even, pasim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:18501
msgid "Margin Notes\n"
"Col Width (mm):"
msgstr "Margin Notes\n"
"Wait bilong Kolum (mm):"

#: temp.glade:18507
msgid "Enabling this will allow Notes (footnotes and/or\n"
"cross-references) and optionally Headings (and\n"
"their corresponding Parallel Passage references)\n"
"to be place in a wider margin area in a way that\n"
"makes them easier to access by the reader."
msgstr "Sapos yu opim dispela, ol Nots (futnot na/o kros-refrens) na ol Heding (wantaim ol refrens bilong Parallel Passage) ken i go long bikpela margin, na ol man i ritim i ken painim isi."

#: temp.glade:18529
msgid "This is the width (mm) of the additional column \n"
"which contains the Margin Notes (Footnotes, \n"
"Cross-references and/or Section Headings)."
msgstr "Dispela em wait (mm) bilong kolum i kam moa we i holim ol Margin Notes (Futnot, Kros-refrens na/o Heding bilong Sekson)."

#: temp.glade:18556
msgid "Margin Notes on Left/Inner"
msgstr "Margin Notes long Left/Inner"

#: temp.glade:18561
msgid "Margin Notes are normally placed on the\n"
"Right/Outer edge of the page. But this can\n"
"be changed for single column layouts to\n"
"appear on the Left/Inner edge if needed.\n"
"(Not available for two-column layouts.)"
msgstr "Ol Margin Nots i save stap long\n"
"rait/aut sait bilong pes. Tasol sapos yu laik,\n"
"yu ken senisim long wanpela kolum layout na ol i stap\n"
"long let/insait sait.\n"
"(I no inap long tupela kolum layout.)"

#: temp.glade:18585
msgid "Page Setup"
msgstr "Pes Seting"

#: temp.glade:18624 temp.glade:25233
msgid "This is the space between \n"
"the text of the two columns \n"
"(measured in millimeters)."
msgstr "Dispela em spes namel long tekst bilong tupela kolum (mm)."

#: temp.glade:18651 temp.glade:18708
msgid "This setting raises (using a negative value) or \n"
"lowers (using a positive value) the starting \n"
"point of the vertical rule between columns.\n"
"(Value in pts)."
msgstr "Dispela seting i litimapim (long negatif nambawan) o daunim (long positif nambawan) ples we vertical rule namel long ol kolum i stat. (Nambawan long pt)."

#: temp.glade:18683 temp.glade:25258
msgid "This is the space (mm) between \n"
"the text of the two columns."
msgstr "Dispela em spes (mm) namel long tekst bilong tupela kolum."

#: temp.glade:18688 temp.glade:25263
msgid "Gutter \n"
"Width (mm):"
msgstr "Wait bilong\n"
"Gutter (mm):"

#: temp.glade:18713 temp.glade:25391
msgid "Adjust\n"
"Top (pt):"
msgstr "Senisim\n"
"Het (pt):"

#: temp.glade:18729 temp.glade:18821
msgid "This sets the thickness (pt) of rules (lines)\n"
"in the document. This includes the\n"
"horizontal rule between the header\n"
"and the text, the vertical column gutter\n"
"rule and the study notes inter-column rule."
msgstr "Dispela i makim bikpela (pt) bilong ol rule (lain) long dokumen. Dispela i gat rule namel long heda na tekst, vertical rule bilong gutter bilong kolum, na rule namel long kolum bilong ol study notes."

#: temp.glade:18754 temp.glade:18755 temp.glade:25363
msgid "Vertical Rule in Gutter"
msgstr "Vertical Rule long Gutter"

#: temp.glade:18759 temp.glade:25368
msgid "Check this option to include a center\n"
"line between the two columns."
msgstr "Makim dispela opsen long putim wanpela lain long namel bilong tupela kolum."

#: temp.glade:18778 temp.glade:18779
msgid "Allow Unbalanced Columns"
msgstr "Larim Kolum i No Wankain"

#: temp.glade:18783
msgid "Check this option to allow a different\n"
"number of lines in each column. This\n"
"is especially important when using\n"
"Variable Line Spacing mode and\n"
"you are trying to Fill Columns.\n"
"\n"
"To alter the maximum number of\n"
"Unbalanced Lines at the end of a\n"
"page, visit the Advanced page,\n"
"select the Other tab, and expand\n"
"the Page Layout and Spacing section.\n"
"\n"
"If this setting is highlighted in orange\n"
"it means that the above-mentioned\n"
"setting was set to 0 (rendering this\n"
"setting inactive), and has now been\n"
"increased to the default value of 3."
msgstr "Tikim dispela long larim namba bilong lain i\n"
"senis long wanwan kolum. Dispela i bikpela samting\n"
"taim yu yusim Variable Line Spacing mode na\n"
"yu laik Fill Columns.\n"
"\n"
"Bilong senisim bikpela namba bilong\n"
"Unbalanced Lines long pinis bilong\n"
"pes, go long Advanced pes,\n"
"makim Other tab, na opim\n"
"Page Layout and Spacing seksen.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela seting i orens kala,\n"
"meaning bilong en, seting i stap antap i bin 0\n"
"(na dispela seting i no wok), na nau i go antap\n"
"long namba 3 olsem default."

#: temp.glade:18827
msgid "Thickness\n"
"of Rule (pt):"
msgstr "Bikpela\n"
"bilong Rule (pt):"

#: temp.glade:18875
msgid "Tick to set the main text in two columns;\n"
"untick for a single column.\n"
"\n"
"If this setting is checked on, but\n"
"inactive, it is due to Diglot being\n"
"active (which obviously must use \n"
"the Two Column layout).\n"
"\n"
"If you get an unexpected result, check\n"
"the \"Use One/Two Column Layout ...\"\n"
"setting near the end of the Body tab\n"
"which is only accessible when using\n"
"the Full View mode."
msgstr "Tikim bilong putim tok bilong buk long tupela kolum;\n"
"rausim tik bilong wanpela kolum.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela i gat tik tasol i no wok, em bikos\n"
"Diglot i wok (na Diglot i mas yusim\n"
"Two Column layout).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu kisim wanpela samting yu no tingting long en,\n"
"sekim seting \"Use One/Two Column Layout ...\"\n"
"klostu long pinis bilong Body tab, na em i stap\n"
"tasol taim yu yusim Full View mode."

#: temp.glade:18947
msgid "This setting determines the vertical positioning\n"
"of the header line by setting the amount of space\n"
"between the header and the top of the text. (pts)\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Dispela seting i makim ples bilong heda lain long ap na daun, long makim hamas spes i stap namel long heda na het bilong tekst. (pt)\n"
"\n"
"Het bilong tekst i stap wanpela base line spacing antap long base line bilong namba wan lain bilong tekst."

#: temp.glade:18983
msgid "This setting can be used to increase/decrease the \n"
"space between the end of the text and the footer line."
msgstr "Yu ken usim dispela seting long mekim spes i bikpela o i liklik\n"
"bilong namel long pinis bilong tok na footer line."

#: temp.glade:19015 temp.glade:19839
msgid "The distance (mm) from the bottom of the \n"
"main text area to the bottom of the page.\n"
"\n"
"The bottom of the main text area is calculated\n"
"from the descender of the final line of text \n"
"(including any footnotes)."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) bilong as bilong\n"
"main text area i go long as bilong pes.\n"
"\n"
"Ol i kaunim as bilong main text area\n"
"stat long descender bilong las lain bilong tok\n"
"(wantaim ol footnote tu)."

#: temp.glade:19052 temp.glade:19673
msgid "The distance (mm) from the \n"
"edge of the page to the start\n"
"of the text area. Note that the\n"
"left and right (or inner and \n"
"outer) margins are set to be\n"
"identical. If you require a \n"
"greater inner margin, then\n"
"set the Binding Gutter above."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) bilong kona bilong pes\n"
"i go long stat bilong text area. Lukim, left na\n"
"right (o inner na outer) margin i stap wankain.\n"
"Sapos yu laik gat bikpela inner margin,\n"
"orait seitim Binding Gutter antap."

#: temp.glade:19067
msgid "0.0"
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:19090 temp.glade:19777
msgid "The space (pt) between the horizontal rule\n"
"and the top of the main text area. Note that\n"
"the first line actually starts a little bit below\n"
"where the main text area starts.\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Spes (pt) namba tupela bilong horizontal rul\n"
"na antap bilong hap tok bilong buk. Tingim olsem\n"
"pastaim lain i stat liklik daunbilo long\n"
"hap we hap tok i stat.\n"
"\n"
"Antap bilong hap tok i stap 1 base line spesing\n"
"antap long base line bilong namba wan lain bilong bodi tekst."

#: temp.glade:19127 temp.glade:19709
msgid "The distance (mm) from the top of the page\n"
"to the top of the main text area. Note that\n"
"the first line actually starts a little bit below\n"
"where the main text area starts.\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) i stat long antap bilong pes\n"
"i go long antap bilong hap tok bilong buk. Tingim olsem\n"
"pastaim lain i stat liklik daunbilo long\n"
"hap we hap tok i stat.\n"
"\n"
"Antap bilong hap tok i stap 1 base line spesing\n"
"antap long base line bilong namba wan lain bilong bodi tekst."

#: temp.glade:19166
msgid "Fine Tune Top Margin:\n"
"\n"
"This button is only active when PTXprint has a suggestion to\n"
"shrink or expand the top margin slightly to minimise wasted \n"
"vertical space on the page. Click to accept the suggestion.\n"
"\n"
"If there is more than half a line of 'spare' space on the \n"
"page then the top margin will decrease slightly to\n"
"fit one more line of text on the page.\n"
"\n"
"If there is less than half a line of 'spare' space on the \n"
"page then the top margin will increase slightly to \n"
"fill the page more evenly (with the same number of \n"
"lines of text).\n"
"\n"
"If you prefer to keep the exact top margin specified, \n"
"then do NOT click this option. Instead, use the similar\n"
"button to adjust either the Line Spacing or Bottom Margin."
msgstr "Fine Tune Top Margin:\n"
"\n"
"Dispela boton i wok tasol taim PTXprint i gat tingting\n"
"long mekim top margin i liklik o i bikpela liklik, bilong\n"
"rausim spes i no gat yus long pes. Klikim long kisim tingting.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat moa long hap lain bilong 'spare' spes long\n"
"pes, orait top margin bai i liklik liklik\n"
"long putim wanpela moa lain tok long pes.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat liklik long hap lain bilong 'spare' spes long\n"
"pes, orait top margin bai i bikpela liklik\n"
"long pulapim pes gut moa (wantaim namba bilong\n"
"lain tok i wankain).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik holim stret top margin yu makim,\n"
"orait i no ken klikim dispela. Yusim narapela\n"
"boton i olsem long senisim Line Spacing o Bottom Margin."

#: temp.glade:19201
msgid "Fine Tune Bottom Margin:\n"
"\n"
"This button is only active when PTXprint has a suggestion to\n"
"shrink or expand the bottom margin slightly to minimise wasted \n"
"vertical space on the page. Click to accept the suggestion.\n"
"\n"
"If there is more than half a line of 'spare' space on the \n"
"page then the bottom margin will decrease slightly to\n"
"fit one more line of text on the page.\n"
"\n"
"If there is less than half a line of 'spare' space on the \n"
"page then the bottom margin will increase slightly to \n"
"fill the page more evenly (with the same number of \n"
"lines of text).\n"
"\n"
"If you prefer to keep the exact bottom margin specified, \n"
"then do NOT click this option. Instead, use the similar\n"
"button to adjust either the Line Spacing or Top Margin."
msgstr "Fine Tune Bottom Margin:\n"
"\n"
"Dispela boton i wok tasol taim PTXprint i gat tingting\n"
"long mekim bottom margin i liklik o i bikpela liklik, bilong\n"
"rausim spes i no gat yus long pes. Klikim long kisim tingting.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat moa long hap lain bilong 'spare' spes long\n"
"pes, orait bottom margin bai i liklik liklik\n"
"long putim wanpela moa lain tok long pes.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat liklik long hap lain bilong 'spare' spes long\n"
"pes, orait bottom margin bai i bikpela liklik\n"
"long pulapim pes gut moa (wantaim namba bilong\n"
"lain tok i wankain).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik holim stret bottom margin yu makim,\n"
"orait i no ken klikim dispela. Yusim narapela\n"
"boton i olsem long senisim Line Spacing o Top Margin."

#: temp.glade:19544
msgid "Place Footer Text Above the Bottom Margin"
msgstr "Putim Footer Text i Antap long Bottom Margin"

#: temp.glade:19549
msgid "Normally the footer page number sits\n"
"in the bottom margin. \n"
"\n"
"However if you need the page number to\n"
"be placed above the bottom margin (where\n"
"the text would normally flow until) then \n"
"enable this option."
msgstr "Olgeta taim namba bilong pes long fut i stap\n"
"long daunbilo margin.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos yu laik namba bilong pes i stap antap long\n"
"daunbilo margin (we tok bilong buk i save ran i go inap long en),\n"
"orait opim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:19579
msgid "The distance (mm) from the edge of the page\n"
"to the bottom of the footer area."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) bilong kona bilong pes\n"
"i go long as bilong footer area."

#: temp.glade:19584 temp.glade:19648
msgid "8.5mm"
msgstr "8.5mm"

#: temp.glade:19599 temp.glade:19600
msgid "Horizontal Rule"
msgstr "Horizontal Rule"

#: temp.glade:19604
msgid "Check this option to add a horizontal\n"
"line under the page header, before the\n"
"main body text begins."
msgstr "Makim dispela long putim wanpela horizontal\n"
"lain aninit long header bilong pes, pastaim long\n"
"main tok i stat."

#: temp.glade:19623 temp.glade:31430 temp.glade:31443
msgid " "
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:19641
msgid "The distance (mm) from the top of the page\n"
"to the top of the header area. Note that due to \n"
"the ascent of the font, the header text actually \n"
"starts a little bit below the top of the header area."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) bilong antap bilong pes\n"
"i go long antap bilong header area. Lukim, bikos bilong\n"
"ascent bilong font, header text i stat liklik daunbilo\n"
"long antap bilong header area."

#: temp.glade:19684
msgid "Side Margin\n"
"Width (mm):"
msgstr "Bikpela bilong\n"
"Side Margin (mm):"

#: temp.glade:19718
msgid "Start of Page to\n"
"Top of Text (mm):"
msgstr "Stat bilong Pes i go\n"
"long Antap bilong Tok (mm):"

#: temp.glade:19743
msgid "The space (pt) between the bottom of the header\n"
"and the top of the main text area. Note that\n"
"the first line actually starts a little bit below\n"
"where the main text area starts.\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Spes (pt) namba tupela bilong daunbilo bilong het\n"
"na antap bilong hap tok bilong buk. Tingim olsem\n"
"pastaim lain i stat liklik daunbilo long\n"
"hap we hap tok i stat.\n"
"\n"
"Antap bilong hap tok i stap 1 base line spesing\n"
"antap long base line bilong namba wan lain bilong bodi tekst."

#: temp.glade:19752
msgid "Bottom of Header\n"
"to Top of Text (pt):"
msgstr "As bilong Header i go\n"
"long Antap bilong Tok (pt):"

#: temp.glade:19786
msgid "Space between Rule\n"
"and Top of Text (pt):"
msgstr "Spes namel long Rule\n"
"na Antap bilong Tok (pt):"

#: temp.glade:19811
msgid "The distance (pt) from the bottom of the text area\n"
"to the TOP of the footer (including ascenders)."
msgstr "Longpela (pt) bilong as bilong text area\n"
"i go long ANTAP bilong footer (wantaim ol ascender)."

#: temp.glade:19815
msgid "Bottom of Text to\n"
"Top of Footer (pt):"
msgstr "As bilong Tok i go\n"
"long Antap bilong Footer (pt):"

#: temp.glade:19848
msgid "Bottom of Text to\n"
"End of Page (mm):"
msgstr "As bilong Tok i go\n"
"long Pinis bilong Pes (mm):"

#: temp.glade:19872
msgid "Margins"
msgstr "Ol Margin"

#: temp.glade:19892
msgid "Page Setup, Font Size and Line Spacing. \n"
"Margins, Columns and Rules (lines)."
msgstr "Page Setup, Bikpela bilong Font na Line Spacing.\n"
"Ol Margin, Column na Rule (ol lain)."

#: temp.glade:19952
msgid "Bold:"
msgstr "Bold:"

#: temp.glade:19964
msgid "Italic:"
msgstr "Italic:"

#: temp.glade:19976
msgid "Bold Italic:"
msgstr "Bold Italic:"

#: temp.glade:19989
msgid "Body Text\n"
"(Regular):"
msgstr "Body Text\n"
"(Regular):"

#: temp.glade:19999 temp.glade:20022 temp.glade:20042 temp.glade:20062 temp.glade:20261 temp.glade:32996
msgid "Select Font..."
msgstr "Makim Font..."

#: temp.glade:20005
msgid "Click to select the main font for the publication.\n"
"Note that the font chooser dialog also has a\n"
"number of other options for setting advanced\n"
"font features and, if needed, Graphite rendering."
msgstr "Klikim long makim main font bilong publikesen.\n"
"Olsem tasol, dispela dialog bilong makim font i gat\n"
"sampela narapela opsen bilong seting bilong ol\n"
"advanced font feature na, sapos i gat bilong yusim,\n"
"Graphite rendering."

#: temp.glade:20028
msgid "If you see the style in parentheses (bold)\n"
"this indicates that PTXprint could not\n"
"locate the bold style and will fake the style."
msgstr "Sapos yu lukim stail i stap long parentesis (bold),\n"
"i min olsem PTXprint i no painim bold stail\n"
"na bai em i mekim tasol olsem bold stail."

#: temp.glade:20048
msgid "If you see the style in parentheses (italic)\n"
"this indicates that PTXprint could not\n"
"locate the italic style and will fake the style."
msgstr "Sapos yu lukim stail i stap long parentesis (italic),\n"
"i min olsem PTXprint i no painim italic stail\n"
"na bai em i mekim tasol olsem italic stail."

#: temp.glade:20068
msgid "If you see either of the styles in parentheses (bold)\n"
"or (italic) this indicates that PTXprint could not\n"
"locate the style and will fake the bold-italic style."
msgstr "Sapos yu lukim wanpela long ol stail i stap long parentesis (bold)\n"
"o (italic), i min olsem PTXprint i no painim stail\n"
"na bai em i mekim tasol olsem bold-italic stail."

#: temp.glade:20086
msgid "Refresh Font List:\n"
"If you have recently installed a font but it\n"
"doesn't show in the font list, then try\n"
"clicking this button to refresh the list.\n"
"\n"
"If it still doesn't show up, then try re-installing\n"
"the font (in Windows, locate the font file, then\n"
"right-click on it and select \"Install For All Users\").\n"
"\n"
"And remember to Refresh the Font List again."
msgstr "Nupelaim Lista bilong Font:\n"
"Sapos yu bin instolim wanpela font nau tasol\n"
"tasol em i no kamap long lista bilong font,\n"
"klikim dispela boton long nupelaim lista.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos em i no kamap yet, traim long instolim gen\n"
"font (long Windows, painim fail bilong font,\n"
"na klikim rait long en na makim \"Install For All Users\").\n"
"\n"
"Na tingim long Nupelaim Lista bilong Font gen."

#: temp.glade:20116 temp.glade:20117
msgid "Enable Colored Text (as Specified in Stylesheet)"
msgstr "Putim Kala long Tekst (olsem Stailsit i Makim)"

#: temp.glade:20121
msgid "The marker specifications in stylesheets also\n"
"include the \\Color parameter. If this option\n"
"is checked, then these settings will be used\n"
"to produce colored text output. For example\n"
"the \\wj Words of Jesus\\wj* marker might\n"
"specify \\Color Red which will only take effect\n"
"if this option is also enabled - otherwise all\n"
"text will appear in black."
msgstr "Ol makim bilong marker long ol stailsit i\n"
"kamapim tu \\Color parameter. Sapos dispela opsen\n"
"i gat mak, orait ol dispela seting bai yusim\n"
"long mekim tekst i gat kala. Olsem, marker\n"
"\\wj Words of Jesus\\wj* inap makim \\Color Red,\n"
"na dispela bai wok tasol sapos dispela opsen\n"
"i op tu - sapos i no olsem, olgeta\n"
"tekst bai blak."

#: temp.glade:20149
msgid "To change the script for numbers, click here\n"
"to locate the Digit Mapping setting at the end\n"
"of the Font selection dialog."
msgstr "Long senisim skripsa bilong ol nambawan,\n"
"klikim hia long painim Digit Mapping seting\n"
"long las bilong dialog bilong makim font."

#: temp.glade:20180
msgid "Font Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigureisen bilong Font"

#: temp.glade:20212
msgid "Find Missing\n"
"Characters:"
msgstr "Painim Ol Leta\n"
"I Lus:"

#: temp.glade:20218
msgid "If the primary font is missing any characters\n"
"(special punctuation, quotes or glossary markers), \n"
"then these can be listed here, and handled using\n"
"the Font specified below.\n"
"\n"
"It is recommended that you select as many\n"
"scripture books as available before using\n"
"this tool to find missing characters.\n"
"\n"
"Note that the following characters are reserved\n"
"and are ignored by the Fallback font functionality:\n"
"           \\u2018 \\u2019 \\u201c \\u201d * # %"
msgstr "Sapos primary font i no gat sampela leta\n"
"(spesol punktuesen, kot o mak bilong glossary),\n"
"bai yu ken putim ol hia, na yusim\n"
"font i stap daunbilo long handlim ol.\n"
"\n"
"Gutpela yu makim planti buk bilong Skripsa\n"
"olsem yu inap pastaim long yusim\n"
"dispela tul long painim ol leta i lus.\n"
"\n"
"Olsem tasol, ol dispela leta i stap reserv\n"
"na Fallback font i no bosim ol:\n"
"           \\u2018 \\u2019 \\u201c \\u201d * # %"

#: temp.glade:20242
msgid "Select a font to be used as a substitute or\n"
"\"fallback\" for the characters listed above\n"
"which are not in the Regular font.\n"
"\n"
"Note that if the label text is RED, it means \n"
"that the font currently selected doesn't \n"
"have all the missing characters either, \n"
"so it is wise to choose another font."
msgstr "Makim wanpela font long senisim o olsem \"fallback\"\n"
"bilong ol leta i stap antap, ol i no stap\n"
"long Regular font.\n"
"\n"
"Olsem tasol, sapos tekst bilong leibel i RED,\n"
"i min olsem font yu makim nau i no gat\n"
"olgeta leta i lus tu, olsem na gutpela\n"
"yu makim narapela font."

#: temp.glade:20251
msgid "Font to Display any\n"
"Missing Characters:"
msgstr "Font Bilong Soim Ol\n"
"Leta I Lus:"

#: temp.glade:20266
msgid "Click to select a font to be used as a substitute\n"
"or \"fallback\" for the characters listed above\n"
"which are not in the Regular font."
msgstr "Klikim long makim wanpela font long senisim\n"
"o olsem \"fallback\" bilong ol leta i stap antap\n"
"ol i no stap long Regular font."

#: temp.glade:20281
msgid "First use the button (on the left) to find\n"
"any characters missing from the primary\n"
"font. You may add to this list if needed.\n"
"Use spaces between items.\n"
"Note that you can also use \\u0ABC codes\n"
"to enter hard-to-type characters."
msgstr "Pastaim yusim boton (long han kais) long painim\n"
"ol leta i lus long primary font. Yu ken\n"
"adim sampela long dispela lista. Putim spes\n"
"namel long ol.\n"
"Yu ken yusim ol \\u0ABC kod tu\n"
"long raitim ol leta i hat long taipim."

#: temp.glade:20306 temp.glade:20307
msgid "Use Fallback Font"
msgstr "Yusim Fallback Font"

#: temp.glade:20311
msgid "This setting is used to prevent \"tofu\" boxes [] in \n"
"the printed text. If the primary font is missing any\n"
"special characters (for example curly quotes),\n"
"then an alternative \"fallback\" font can be used\n"
"to ensure that they are displayed properly."
msgstr "Dispela seting i stopim ol \"tofu\" bokis [] long\n"
"tekst i go long print. Sapos primary font i no gat\n"
"sampela spesol leta (olsem curly kot),\n"
"wanpela narapela \"fallback\" font i ken yusim\n"
"long soim ol stret."

#: temp.glade:20358 temp.glade:20359
msgid "Hyphenate"
msgstr "Hyphenate"

#: temp.glade:20363
msgid "To hyphenate properly you need to first create a \n"
"Hyphenation List using the 'Create List...' button.\n"
"This will create a XeTeX hyphenation list from the\n"
"hyphenation list in Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"Note that for Hyphenation to work properly, the\n"
"Spacing Adjustments 'Between Letters' option needs \n"
"to be disabled."
msgstr "Bilong mekim hyphenation stret, yu mas kamapim\n"
"Hyphenation List pastaim long boton 'Create List...'.\n"
"Dispela bai kamapim wanpela XeTeX hyphenation list\n"
"llong hyphenation list i stap long Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem bilong hyphenation i wok stret,\n"
"opsen 'Between Letters' bilong Spacing Adjustments\n"
"i mas i no wok."

#: temp.glade:20383
msgid "Create List..."
msgstr "Kamapim List..."

#: temp.glade:20388
msgid "Click this button to generate a hyphenation \n"
"list that can be used by XeTeX to optimize\n"
"hyphenation. This will read Paratext's\n"
"HyphenatedWords.txt list and create a\n"
"TeX hyphen list for this language."
msgstr "Klikim dispela boton long kamapim wanpela\n"
"lista bilong hyphenation we XeTeX inap yusim\n"
"long mekim hyphenation i gutpela. Em bai ridim\n"
"lista HyphenatedWords.txt bilong Paratext na kamapim\n"
"TeX hyphen lista bilong dispela tokples."

#: temp.glade:20406
msgid "Omit '-'Hyphen"
msgstr "Rausim '-' Hyphen"

#: temp.glade:20411
msgid "Some scripts use hyphenation to break long\n"
"words onto the next line, BUT don't need to\n"
"display the actual '-' character. If this option\n"
"is checked, then \"hyphens\" will be invisible."
msgstr "Sampela skripsa i yusim hyphenation long brukim ol longpela\n"
"wod i go long narapela lain, TASOL i no nidim long\n"
"soim '-' leta. Sapos dispela opsen\n"
"i gat mak, ol \"hyphen\" bai i no kamap."

#: temp.glade:20426 temp.glade:20427
msgid "Make Hyphens Non-Breaking"
msgstr "Mekim Ol Hyphen I No Brukim Lain"

#: temp.glade:20431
msgid "Enable this option to ensure that word-medial hyphens\n"
"within the text never break across two lines.\n"
"\n"
"By default, lines may break at\n"
"word-medial hyphens.\n"
"\n"
"If enabled, lines will not break\n"
"at these hyphens."
msgstr "Opim dispela opsen bilong strongim olsem ol hyphen\n"
"long namel bilong wanpela wod long tok i no inap brukim\n"
"lain i go long tupela lain.\n"
"\n"
"Olgeta taim, ol lain i ken brukim\n"
"long ol hyphen long namel bilong wod.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos opsen i wok, ol lain bai i no brukim\n"
"long ol hyphen ia."

#: temp.glade:20459
msgid "Hyphenation"
msgstr "Hyphenation"

#: temp.glade:20503
msgid "Between Words"
msgstr "Namel long Ol Wod"

#: temp.glade:20508
msgid "The horizontal distance that the space\n"
"character can use between words is\n"
"adjustable - and allows a greater degree\n"
"of flexibility when trying to shrink or\n"
"grow paragrahs when balancing pages."
msgstr "Spes namel long ol wod inap senis -\n"
"na dispela i larim moa fleksibiliti taim yu traim\n"
"long mekim ol paragraf i liklik o i bikpela\n"
"long balansim ol pes."

#: temp.glade:20527
msgid "Between Letters"
msgstr "Namel long ol Leta"

#: temp.glade:20532
msgid "Enabling letter spacing allows the spaces between\n"
"characters to be adjusted (usually by a very small\n"
"percentage). This might help alleviate space problems.\n"
"Values are in percentage of the text point size and \n"
"get used everywhere. \n"
"\n"
"Warning: Only use this if really needed!\n"
"In some cases, enabling this setting will prevent\n"
"hyphenation from working at all. In other cases it \n"
"can make the text look very ugly.\n"
"\n"
"Note that if this option is disabled, then it is due to\n"
"the Interlinear option being set on the Advanced page.\n"
"These two settings are mutually exclusive.\n"
"\n"
"Letter spacing is also not used if 'Contextual\n"
"Spaces' is set for the Regular font."
msgstr "Taim yu opim letter spacing, spes namel long\n"
"ol leta i ken senis (i save liklik tru).\n"
"Dispela i ken helpim sapos i gat hevi long spes.\n"
"Ol velu i stap long pesen bilong sais bilong tekst na\n"
"ol i wok long olgeta hap.\n"
"\n"
"Worning: Yusim dispela sapos yu nidim tru tasol!\n"
"Sampela taim, dispela seting i stopim hyphenation\n"
"long i no wok olgeta. Long sampela narapela taim,\n"
"i ken mekim tekst i luk nogut tru.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela opsen i no wok, em bikos\n"
"Interlinear opsen i stap long Advanced pes.\n"
"Dispela tupela seting i no ken wok wantaim.\n"
"\n"
"Letter spacing i no wok tu sapos 'Contextual\n"
"Spaces' i stap long Regular font."

#: temp.glade:20566
msgid "When justifying paragraphs, and especially when\n"
"trying to shrink or grow a paragraph to take fewer\n"
"or more lines, the horizontal distance that a space\n"
"uses can be adjusted - allowing the text to shrink\n"
"or grow. Lower values will enable a 'tighter' text\n"
"and make it more flexible, but keep the readers in\n"
"mind - and their need to distinguish word-breaks\n"
"with ease. This value is a % percentage of a normal\n"
"space width. TeX's default value is 66%."
msgstr "Taim yu stretim ol paragraf, na moa taim yu laik mekim paragraf i liklik o i bikpela long kisim sotpela o longpela namba bilong lain, yumi ken senisim hamas spes i holim long sait. Dispela i larim tekst i liklik o i bikpela. Liklik namba i mekim tekst i pas moa na i ken senis moa, tasol tingim ol rida - ol i mas lukim gutpela ol brek namel long ol wod. Dispela namba em % bilong stret bikpela bilong wanpela spes. Namba bilong TeX em 66%."

#: temp.glade:20599
msgid "When justifying paragraphs, and especially when\n"
"trying to shrink or grow a paragraph to take fewer\n"
"or more lines, the horizontal distance that a space\n"
"uses can be adjusted - allowing the text to shrink\n"
"or grow. Larger values will enable a 'looser' text\n"
"and make it more flexible to grow, but be careful\n"
"to avoid 'rivers' or white space in paragraphs.\n"
"This value is a % percentage of a normal\n"
"space width. TeX's default value is 150%."
msgstr "Taim yu stretim ol paragraf, na moa taim yu laik mekim paragraf i liklik o i bikpela long kisim sotpela o longpela namba bilong lain, yumi ken senisim hamas spes i holim long sait. Dispela i larim tekst i bikpela. Bikpela namba i mekim tekst i opim moa na i ken bikpela moa, tasol lukaut long ol 'riva' o waitpela spes insait long ol paragraf. Dispela namba em % bilong stret bikpela bilong wanpela spes. Namba bilong TeX em 150%."

#: temp.glade:20631
msgid "Values are in percentage of the text point size."
msgstr "Ol namba em % bilong bikpela bilong tekst (point size)."

#: temp.glade:20650
msgid "Values are in percentage of the text point size.\n"
msgstr "Ol namba em % bilong bikpela bilong tekst (point size).\n"

#: temp.glade:20669
msgid "Minimum size % that a space\n"
"can shrink to when necessary."
msgstr "Liklik sais % we wanpela spes\n"
"i ken go daun long en taim i gat nid."

#: temp.glade:20673
msgid "Min/Shrink"
msgstr "Min/Shrink"

#: temp.glade:20688
msgid "Maximum size % that a space\n"
"can grow to when necessary."
msgstr "Bikpela % long wanpela spes i ken kamap\n"
"bikpela long en taim i gat nid."

#: temp.glade:20692
msgid "Max/Stretch"
msgstr "Max/Stretch"

#: temp.glade:20719
msgid "Spacing Adjustments"
msgstr "Senisim Spes"

#: temp.glade:20753 temp.glade:20771
msgid "Select the direction for the text to flow. \n"
"Note that the option for \"Top to Bottom\"\n"
"lays out the vertical lines left to right."
msgstr "Makim wei bilong tekst i go.\n"
"Kirap: \"Top to Bottom\" i putim ol lain i go\n"
"stret daun long han kais i go long han skru."

#: temp.glade:20757
msgid "Text Flow\n"
"Direction:"
msgstr "Wei bilong\n"
"Tekst:"

#: temp.glade:20793
msgid "Text\n"
"Script:"
msgstr "Skript\n"
"bilong Tekst:"

#: temp.glade:20807
msgid "Choose the script of the text. It is used for\n"
"font shaping, and PTXprint provides additional\n"
"typesetting functionality for some scripts:\n"
"Arabic, Myanmar, Thai, Lao, Tai Tham, New Tai Lue,\n"
"Bengali, Malayalam, Tamil, Sinhala, Telugu,\n"
"Kannada, Oriya, and Chinese (Han).\n"
"\n"
"If set to \"Default\", PTXprint tries to detect\n"
"the script when the project is opened."
msgstr "Makim skript bilong tekst. Em i yusim long\n"
"font shaping, na PTXprint i givim moa wok bilong\n"
"typesetting long sampela skript:\n"
"Arabic, Myanmar, Thai, Lao, Tai Tham, New Tai Lue,\n"
"Bengali, Malayalam, Tamil, Sinhala, Telugu,\n"
"Kannada, Oriya, na Chinese (Han).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu setim long \"Default\", PTXprint bai traim\n"
"painim skript taim projek i opim."

#: temp.glade:20834 temp.glade:20835
msgid "Additional Script Settings..."
msgstr "Narapela Seting bilong Skript..."

#: temp.glade:20840
msgid "A small number of complex scripts (such as\n"
"Myanmar, Indic, Arabic & Han) have additional\n"
"options which can be set individually."
msgstr "Sampela hap skript i hat (olsem\n"
"Myanmar, Indic, Arabic & Han) i gat moa\n"
"opsen yu ken setim wanwan."

#: temp.glade:20857
msgid "Complex\n"
"Scripts:"
msgstr "Hatwok\n"
"Skript:"

#: temp.glade:20867
msgid "Specify Line\n"
"Break Locale:"
msgstr "Makim Lokel\n"
"bilong Brekim Lain:"

#: temp.glade:20873
msgid "Some languages that use complex scripts need\n"
"dictionary support for line breaking. Note that\n"
"the dictionary used will be LWC-specific.\n"
"For example, zh for Chinese, ko for Korean, etc.\n"
"Note that Graphite fonts can also have line breaking\n"
"rules which can be enabled by using the gr locale."
msgstr "Sampela tokples i yusim hatwok skript i nidim\n"
"sapot bilong diksenari long brekim lain. Tingim\n"
"olsem diksenari i bilong LWC tasol.\n"
"Taim: zh bilong Sainis, ko bilong Koria, na ol narapela.\n"
"Ol Graphite font tu i ken gat lo bilong brekim lain\n"
"na yu ken opim wantaim gr lokel."

#: temp.glade:20896
msgid "Language code for dictionary-based\n"
"line breaking (for scripts without\n"
"spaces between words):\n"
"ja = Japanese\n"
"km = Khmer\n"
"ko = Korean\n"
"my = Myanmar\n"
"th = Thai\n"
"zh = Chinese\n"
"   OR\n"
"gr = Graphite"
msgstr "Kod bilong tok ples bilong brukim lain\n"
"long dikseneri (long ol skript i no gat\n"
"spes namel long ol wod):\n"
"ja = Japanis\n"
"km = Kmer\n"
"ko = Koria\n"
"my = Myanmar\n"
"th = Tai\n"
"zh = Sainis\n"
"   O\n"
"gr = Graphite"

#: temp.glade:20928
msgid "RTL Book\n"
"Binding"
msgstr "RTL Bainim\n"
"bilong Buk"

#: temp.glade:20934
msgid "Enable this for Right-to-Left\n"
"publications (so that the book\n"
"is bound on the right hand side)."
msgstr "Yusim dispela long ol buk bilong Right-to-Left\n"
"(olsem na buk i bin bainim long han ras)."

#: temp.glade:20954
msgid "Writing System"
msgstr "Sistem bilong Rait"

#: temp.glade:20987
msgid "Basic Fonts and Advanced Font options.\n"
"Also a range of Advanced typography\n"
"settings to support any Writing System.\n"
"Advanced Spacing Settings. Fallback fonts\n"
"for characters missing in primary font."
msgstr "Ol Basic Font na ol Advanced Font seting.\n"
"Ol Advanced typography seting tu long sapotim\n"
"wanpela Sistem bilong Rait. Advanced Spacing seting.\n"
"Fallback font bilong ol leta i no stap long primary font."

#: temp.glade:21039
msgid "Book Introductions"
msgstr "Ol Introdaksen bilong Buk"

#: temp.glade:21044
msgid "Print the Book Introductions which\n"
"appear at the beginning of each book.\n"
"Includes markers like: \\is \\ip \\im \\ili etc."
msgstr "Printim ol Introdaksen bilong Buk i stap\n"
"long stat bilong olgeta buk.\n"
"I gat ol marka olsem: \\is \\ip \\im \\ili na ol narapela."

#: temp.glade:21060
msgid "Introductory Outlines"
msgstr "Ol Introdaksen Aotlain"

#: temp.glade:21065
msgid "Print the Introductory Outlines which\n"
"appear at the beginning of each book.\n"
"Includes markers: \\io1 ... \\io4 \\ior \\iot"
msgstr "Printim ol Introdaksen Aotlain i stap\n"
"long stat bilong olgeta buk.\n"
"I gat ol marka: \\io1 ... \\io4 \\ior \\iot"

#: temp.glade:21081
msgid "Right-align \\ior With Tabbed Leaders"
msgstr "Putim \\ior long Han Ras wantaim Tabbed Leader"

#: temp.glade:21086
msgid "This will right-align and add leader tabs (. . . .) before the \\ior numbers for a pretty Intro Outline Table."
msgstr "Dispela bai putim ol \\ior namba long sait i stret long rait na putim leader tab (. . . .) paslain long ol, bilong mekim Intro Outline Table i luk gutpela."

#: temp.glade:21098
msgid "Filter Glossary to Only Include Entries Used in the Text"
msgstr "Filta Glossary long Ol Entri Tasol i Stap long Tekst"

#: temp.glade:21103
msgid "This option only has an effect if the Glossary\n"
"(GLO) is one of the books being printed.\n"
"If you have large glossary with many entries \n"
"but are only printing a small selection of books, \n"
"you may benefit from this option which will \n"
"strip out any entries from the Glossary which\n"
"are not marked-up in the text of the selected \n"
"book(s) or chapter(s).\n"
"i.e. only the \\w marked-up\\w* entries in the \n"
"selected books/chapters will show in the glossary.\n"
"Entries marked up inside a kept entry\n"
"are also kept."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i wok tasol sapos Glossary\n"
"(GLO) em i wanpela bilong ol buk yu printim.\n"
"Sapos yu gat bikpela glossary wantaim planti entri\n"
"tasol yu printim sampela buk tasol,\n"
"dispela opsen i ken helpim yu. Em i rausim ol entri\n"
"bilong Glossary we i no gat mark long tekst bilong\n"
"ol buk o kapitel yu makim.\n"
"Ie. ol entri tasol i gat \\w mark-ap\\w* long\n"
"ol buk/kapitel yu makim i bai soim long glossary.\n"
"Ol entri i gat mark insait long wanpela entri\n"
"yu holim i stap tu."

#: temp.glade:21126
msgid "Start All Other Chapters on a New Page"
msgstr "Statim Olgeta Narapela Kapitel long Nupela Pes"

#: temp.glade:21131
msgid "Use this option to force a page break before\n"
"every chapter. This is most commonly used\n"
"for testing materials when each chapter needs\n"
"to be printed and given to a different person."
msgstr "Usim dispela opsen bilong strongim wanpela pes brek paslain long olgeta kapitel.\n"
"Ol i usim planti taim bilong testim ol materil, taim ol i laik printim wanpela wanpela kapitel na givim long narapela narapela man."

#: temp.glade:21146
msgid "Start 1st Chapter on a New Page"
msgstr "Statim Kapitel 1 long Nupela Pes"

#: temp.glade:21151
msgid "Use this option to automatically make a page \n"
"break after a book's introduction section. \n"
"The break will come right before the \\c 1 marker."
msgstr "Usim dispela opsen bilong mekim pes brek stret\n"
"bihain long introdaksen bilong wanpela buk.\n"
"Pes brek bai kam stret paslain long \\c 1 marker."

#: temp.glade:21172
msgid "Beginning and Ending Material"
msgstr "Materil Bilong Stat na Pinis"

#: temp.glade:21210
msgid "Hide First Verse Number"
msgstr "Haidim Namba bilong Namba Wan Ves"

#: temp.glade:21215
msgid "It is quite common to hide the first verse\n"
"number - especially when following a\n"
"drop-cap chapter number. By default this\n"
"option is on. If you prefer to see verse\n"
"number 1, then uncheck this option.\n"
"\n"
"Note: verse 1 is only hidden when it follows\n"
"a drop-cap chapter number, or when marginal\n"
"verses are used."
msgstr "I save ol i hait namba bilong ves wan -\n"
"spesol taim i kam bihain long bikpela leta\n"
"bilong namba kapitel. Olgeta taim dispela\n"
"opsen i wok. Sapos yu laik lukim\n"
"ves namba 1, rausim tik bilong dispela opsen.\n"
"\n"
"Not: ves 1 i hait tasol taim em i kam bihain long\n"
"drop-cap namba kapitel, o taim ol ves long sait\n"
"i stap."

#: temp.glade:21236
msgid "Keep Repeated Words Together"
msgstr "Holim Ol Tok Ripit Wantaim"

#: temp.glade:21241
msgid "This option encourages re-duplicated\n"
"words (i.e. those which are intentionally\n"
"repeated) to come together on the same line\n"
"by inserting a NoBreakSpace between them\n"
"(only words of 3 or more letters).\n"
"For example, \"gama gama\", or \"kala kala\" \n"
"need to be stuck together (with a NBSP)\n"
"in order to be read meaningfully.\n"
"However, if there are many of these in the\n"
"language, then it may create other unwanted\n"
"typesetting issues. Use with care!"
msgstr "Dispela opsen i helpim ol wod i kam tupela taim\n"
"(ol i makim long ol i kam bek)\n"
"bilong stap wantaim long wanpela lain\n"
"long putim wanpela NoBreakSpace namel long ol\n"
"(ol wod i gat 3 o moa leta tasol).\n"
"Pastaim, \"gama gama\" o \"kala kala\"\n"
"i mas pas wantaim (long NBSP)\n"
"bilong ol i gat gutpela mining taim ol i rit.\n"
"Tasol sapos i gat planti olsem long\n"
"langgus, dispela i ken mekim narapela hevi\n"
"long typesetting. Yusim wantaim tingting!"

#: temp.glade:21263
msgid "Indent First Paragraph"
msgstr "Indent long Namba Wan Paragraf"

#: temp.glade:21268
msgid "If this option is unchecked, it will make the 1st\n"
"\\p(aragraph) after a Section Heading appear as\n"
"a \\m(argin) paragraph with no indentation."
msgstr "Sapos yu no makim dispela opsen, namba wan \\p(aragraph) bihain long Section Heading bai i kamap olsem \\m(argin) paragraf i no gat indent."

#: temp.glade:21283
msgid "Hanging Poetry Verse Numbers"
msgstr "Hanging Namba bilong Ves long Poetri"

#: temp.glade:21288
msgid "Verse numbers for Poetry elements all\n"
"line up vertically on the margin, and\n"
"Verse Bridges (3-4) also stack vertically."
msgstr "Ol namba bilong ves bilong ol poetri i stap stret long wanpela lain long margin, na Verse Bridges (3-4) tu i stap antap long ananit."

#: temp.glade:21303
msgid "Prevent Verse Widow Words "
msgstr "Pasim Ol Sotpela Tok i No Ken Stap Wanwan Bihain long Ves "

#: temp.glade:21308
msgid "This option prevents short words (of\n"
"3 characters or less) from occurring\n"
"AFTER a verse begins near the end of \n"
"a line."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i pasim ol sotpela tok (3 leta o i liklik moa) long kamap BIHAIN long wanpela ves i stat klostu long pinis bilong wanpela lain."

#: temp.glade:21323
msgid "Prevent Orphan Words"
msgstr "Pasim Ol Orfan Tok"

#: temp.glade:21328
msgid "This option limits short words\n"
"at the ends of paragraphs from \n"
"occurring on a line on their own.\n"
"It also prevents short words at \n"
"the end of sentences from starting \n"
"on a new line.\n"
"\n"
"The maximum orphan word length can be set\n"
"in the 'Body Text' section of the\n"
"Advanced > Other tab."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i stopim ol sotpela wod\n"
"long pinis bilong paragraf long i no kamap\n"
"long wanpela lain bilong ol yet.\n"
"Em i stopim tu ol sotpela wod long pinis\n"
"bilong sentens long i no stat long nupela lain.\n"
"\n"
"Bikpela longpela bilong orfan wod i ken setim\n"
"long 'Body Text' seksen bilong\n"
"Advanced > Other tab."

#: temp.glade:21349
msgid "Justify Paragraphs"
msgstr "Justify Ol Paragraf"

#: temp.glade:21354
msgid "By default the text will be fully justified.\n"
"If you prefer a ragged edge, then uncheck\n"
"this option.\n"
"\n"
"Note that a justification setting of \"Justify\"\n"
"in a style is subject to this setting."
msgstr "Olsem lo, tekst bai i fulap justify.\n"
"Sapos yu laik long wanpela sait i no stret, uncheck\n"
"dispela opsen.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim: seting bilong \"Justify\"\n"
"long wanpela stail i stap aninit long dispela seting."

#: temp.glade:21377
msgid "Headings"
msgstr "Ol Heding"

#: temp.glade:21382
msgid "Uncheck this option if you don't want\n"
"to print any Section Headings.\n"
"Unchecking this option will ALSO \n"
"uncheck the Parallel Passage Refs."
msgstr "Uncheck dispela opsen sapos yu no laik\n"
"printim ol Section Heading.\n"
"Sapos yu uncheck dispela opsen, Parallel Passage Refs\n"
"i bai uncheck tu."

#: temp.glade:21405 temp.glade:21480 temp.glade:21735 temp.glade:21787 temp.glade:22169 temp.glade:27060
msgid "Click to edit the marker's properties on the Styles tab."
msgstr "Klikim bilong senisim ol praperti bilong marker long Styles tab."

#: temp.glade:21420
msgid "In Margin"
msgstr "Long Margin"

#: temp.glade:21425
msgid "If Margin Notes has been enabled on\n"
"the Layout Tab, it is possible to also \n"
"place the Section Headings in the margin.\n"
"Note that Parallel Passage Refs (if used)\n"
"will also be placed in the margin area. "
msgstr "Sapos Margin Notes i op long Layout Tab, yu ken putim ol Section Heading long margin tu.\n"
"Tingim: Parallel Passage Refs (sapos yu usim) bai i stap long margin tu. "

#: temp.glade:21453
msgid "Parallel Passage Refs "
msgstr "Parallel Passage Refs "

#: temp.glade:21458
msgid "Uncheck this option to hide all the\n"
"Parallel Passage References which\n"
"occur below Section Headings."
msgstr "Rausim tik bilong dispela opsen long hait olgeta\n"
"Parallel Passage Refs i kamap daunbilo\n"
"long ol Hedin bilong Seksen."

#: temp.glade:21504
msgid "Hide Empty Verses"
msgstr "Haidim Ol Ves i Empti"

#: temp.glade:21509
msgid "Do not print any empty chapters or verses.\n"
"Useful for when only part of the text has been\n"
"drafted but you still need a printout of whatever\n"
"has been translated so far."
msgstr "Noken printim ol kapitel o ves i no gat tok long en.\n"
"Dispela i gutpela sapos wanpela hap tasol bilong\n"
"tok i go pinis na yu laikim wanpela print bilong olgeta\n"
"hap yu bin tanim pinis i go inap nau."

#: temp.glade:21526
msgid "Show '...'"
msgstr "Soim '...'"

#: temp.glade:21531
msgid "Indicate using ellipsis that verses and/or \n"
"entire chapters are missing by placing '...'\n"
"in the text to alert the reader that some\n"
"parts of the text have been skipped."
msgstr "Putim '...' long tok bilong soim ol ves na/o\n"
"olgeta kapitel i lus, bai ol rider i save olsem\n"
"ol i no putim sampela hap bilong tok."

#: temp.glade:21558
msgid "Marginal Verses:"
msgstr "Ol Ves long Sait:"

#: temp.glade:21563
msgid "Some language communities prefer the\n"
"verse numbers to be displayed in a\n"
"vertical stack NEXT to the text (rather\n"
"than within the text itself). If that is\n"
"what is required, check this option\n"
"and also adjust the width of that\n"
"column to fit the verse numbers."
msgstr "Sampela lain bilong wanpela tokples i laik\n"
"save ol namba bilong ves i stap long wanpela\n"
"lain i go daun BIKLONG tok (i no insait\n"
"long tok yet). Sapos yu laikim olsem,\n"
"makim dispela opsen na senisim bikpela\n"
"bilong dispela kolum bilong fitim ol namba bilong ves."

#: temp.glade:21585 temp.glade:21605
msgid "Marginal verses are usually placed\n"
"on the left of the text, but can be\n"
"positioned elsewhere if needed."
msgstr "Ol ves long sait i stap long han kais bilong tok,\n"
"tasol yu ken putim long narapela hap\n"
"sapos yu laik."

#: temp.glade:21590
msgid "Position on Page: "
msgstr "Ples long Pes: "

#: temp.glade:21634 temp.glade:21652
msgid "This is the amount of space beside the\n"
"column of text to accommodate \n"
"marginal verse numbers. (pts)"
msgstr "Dispela em i hamas spes long sait bilong\n"
"kolum bilong tekst bilong putim ol namba\n"
"bilong ves long sait. (pts)"

#: temp.glade:21639
msgid "Col Width (pts):"
msgstr "Bikpela bilong Kolum (pts):"

#: temp.glade:21705
msgid "Chapter numbers"
msgstr "Ol namba bilong kapitel"

#: temp.glade:21710
msgid "Uncheck this option to hide all chapter \n"
"numbers - making the publication read\n"
"more like an ordinary book.\n"
"\n"
"Note that the 'Single Chapter Books' option\n"
"lower down (Show Chapter Numbers in:) controls\n"
"chapter numbers in one-chapter books only."
msgstr "Rausim tik bilong dispela opsen long hait olgeta namba\n"
"bilong kapitel - na buk i luk olsem wanpela\n"
"buk nating.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem 'Single Chapter Books' opsen\n"
"daunbilo (Show Chapter Numbers in:) i kontrolim\n"
"namba kapitel long ol buk i gat wanpela kapitel tasol."

#: temp.glade:21760
msgid "Verse Numbers"
msgstr "Ol Namba bilong Ves"

#: temp.glade:21765
msgid "Uncheck this option to hide all verse \n"
"numbers - making the publication read\n"
"more like an ordinary book."
msgstr "Rausim makim bilong dispela opsen bilong hait olgeta\n"
"namba bilong ves - na buk bai i luk olsem\n"
"wanpela buk nating."

#: temp.glade:21812
msgid "Include Scripture Text"
msgstr "Putim Tok bilong Skripsa"

#: temp.glade:21817
msgid "Normally you should leave this checked.\n"
"\n"
"BUT... if you require a printout of just the\n"
"book introductions (usually for the\n"
"purpose of final checking, or looking\n"
"for consistency) then this option can\n"
"be unchecked (to omit the verse text\n"
"and everything else in the main body)."
msgstr "Olgeta taim yu mas larim dispela i stap makim.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol... sapos yu laikim print bilong ol introduksen\n"
"bilong buk tasol (long lukluk pinis o long\n"
"painim sapos ol i stret wantaim) orait yu ken\n"
"rausim makim bilong dispela opsen (bilong\n"
"lusim tok bilong ves na olgeta narapela samting\n"
"insait long bodi)."

#: temp.glade:21866
msgid "Use Special Features\n"
"for These Books:"
msgstr "Usim Spesol Pasin\n"
"bilong Ol Dispela Buk:"

#: temp.glade:21872
msgid "Some Poetical books like the Psalms, and maybe even\n"
"Proverbs look better without drop-cap chapter numbers.\n"
"Instead, they can use a prefix like \"Chapter\" or \"Psalm\"\n"
"at the start of the chapter.\n"
"Note: If the text already has one or more \\cl markers, then\n"
"these settings will override what has been set in the text."
msgstr "Sampela buk poetri olsem Ol Sam, na ating Ol Sampela\n"
"Tok Piksa tu i luk gutpela sapos i no gat drop-cap namba kapitel.\n"
"Olsem, ol i ken yusim wanpela prefiks olsem \"Kapitel\" o \"Sam\"\n"
"long stat bilong kapitel.\n"
"Not: Sapos tekst i gat pinis wanpela o moa \\cl mark, orait\n"
"ol dispela seting bai i winim wanem i stap pinis long tekst."

#: temp.glade:21894
msgid "Add the 3-letter book codes for any books that\n"
"this \"Chapter Label\" setting should be applied to.\n"
"\n"
"Note: If this list of books is left empty, then this\n"
"setting will be applied to ALL books"
msgstr "Putim ol kod bilong buk (3 leta) bilong ol buk\n"
"olsem dispela seting bilong \"Chapter Label\" i mas i go long en.\n"
"\n"
"Tingting: Sapos yu larim dispela lista i stap nating,\n"
"dispela seting bai i go long OLGETA buk."

#: temp.glade:21900
msgid "e.g. PSA PRO"
msgstr "olsem PSA PRO"

#: temp.glade:21914 temp.glade:21934
msgid "The chapter “label” to be used when rendering\n"
"chapter divisions as headings (instead of drop-cap\n"
"numerals). For example, \"Chapter\" or \"Psalm\".\n"
"\n"
"If you want the chapter number to appear centered\n"
"and above the Section Header WITHOUT any preceding\n"
"text, then just put the code \\ZWNBSP in here. This will\n"
"insert a Zero Width No-Break Space."
msgstr "Dispela “label” bilong kapitel i bihainim taim ol i soim\n"
"kapitel olsem heding (i no bikpela namba stat).\n"
"Olsem, \"Kapitel\" o \"Psalm\".\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laikim namba bilong kapitel i kamap long namel\n"
"na antap long Section Header, na i no gat wanpela\n"
"tok bipo long en, orait putim dispela kod \\ZWNBSP long hia.\n"
"Ol bai putim Zero Width No-Break Space."

#: temp.glade:21943
msgid "Chapter\n"
"Label:"
msgstr "Chapter\n"
"Label:"

#: temp.glade:21954
msgid "Use One/Two Column\n"
"Layout for These Books:"
msgstr "Usim Wanpela/Tupela Kolum\n"
"bilong Ol Dispela Buk:"

#: temp.glade:21960 temp.glade:22015
msgid "Some books (e.g. Introduction, Glossary, Psalms, and \n"
"maybe even Proverbs) look better formatted as single\n"
"column, even though most of the books are typeset\n"
"in two column layout. This allows the same publication\n"
"to have both single and double column layouts.\n"
"\n"
"Add the 3-letter book codes for any books that should \n"
"be typeset using a different column layout. \n"
"\n"
"Note that if the layout for the entire publication\n"
"is set to single column, then the books listed here\n"
"would use double-column layout. Conversely, if \n"
"the publication is set as double-column (on the \n"
"layout page) then any books listed here would\n"
"be set in single-column layout."
msgstr "Sampela buk (olsem Introduksen, Glossary, Ol Sam, na\n"
"sapos i gat Ol Tok Piksa) i luk gutpela moa sapos i gat\n"
"wanpela kolum, maski planti buk i gat tupela kolum.\n"
"Olsem dispela wanpela buk i ken gat wanpela kolum na\n"
"tupela kolum.\n"
"\n"
"Putim ol kod bilong buk (3 leta) bilong ol buk i mas\n"
"gat narapela kain kolum.\n"
"\n"
"Tingting: Sapos layout bilong olgeta buk i wanpela kolum,\n"
"ol buk i stap long dispela lista bai gat tupela kolum.\n"
"Sapos buk i gat tupela kolum (long pes bilong layout)\n"
"orait ol buk i stap long dispela lista bai gat wanpela kolum."

#: temp.glade:21987 temp.glade:21988
msgid "Optimize Layout for Poetry Books"
msgstr "Stretim Layout bilong Ol Buk Poetri"

#: temp.glade:21992
msgid "Trying to get columns of poetry to balance often\n"
"creates all sorts of unforeseen issues and unwanted\n"
"whitespace. This option allows columns to be \n"
"unbalanced, which might improve the overall look.\n"
"But note that it also allows Widow and Orphan \n"
"lines to occur, which is a negative side-effect.\n"
"It applies only to the books listed above."
msgstr "Taim yumi traim long makim ol kolum bilong poetri\n"
"olsem wankain, planti taim em i kamapim ol hevi\n"
"yumi no tingim na ples nating. Dispela opsen i larim\n"
"ol kolum i no wankain, na dispela inap mekim lukluk\n"
"bilong olgeta i gutpela. Tasol lukim, em i larim tu\n"
"ol Widow na Orphan lain i kamap, em i wanpela\n"
"baksait nogut. Em i wok long ol buk i stap antap tasol."

#: temp.glade:22031
msgid "e.g. FRT INT PSA PRO BAK GLO"
msgstr "olsem FRT INT PSA PRO BAK GLO"

#: temp.glade:22045
msgid "Show Chapter\n"
"Numbers in:"
msgstr "Soim Ol Namba bilong Kapitel\n"
"long:"

#: temp.glade:22059
msgid "Glossary words may be marked up \n"
"with \\w glossary\\w* tags. Specify\n"
"how these words should appear\n"
"in the printed output.\n"
"\n"
"If you wish to apply your own custom\n"
"styling to \\w then select the \\w ...\\w*\n"
"character style option."
msgstr "Ol tok bilong glossary i ken gat \\w glossary\\w* tag.\n"
"Tokim PTXprint olsem wanem ol dispela tok i mas\n"
"sanap long print.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik putim stail bilong yu yet long \\w,\n"
"makim opsen bilong \\w ...\\w* character style."

#: temp.glade:22069
msgid "Glossary Word Appearance:"
msgstr "Pasin bilong Ol Tok bilong Glossary:"

#: temp.glade:22083
msgid "Glossary words are marked up with\n"
"special \\w glossary\\w* tags. Specify\n"
"how these words should be highlighted\n"
"in the printed output.\n"
"\n"
"The final option \\w keeps|markup\\w* as\n"
"it is without removing any parameters\n"
"such as Strong's numbers."
msgstr "Ol tok bilong glossary i gat spesol \\w glossary\\w* tag.\n"
"Tokim PTXprint olsem wanem ol dispela tok i mas\n"
"sanap bikpela long print.\n"
"\n"
"Last opsen \\w keeps|markup\\w* i lusim olgeta\n"
"olsem i stap, na i no rausim wanpela parameter\n"
"olsem namba bilong Strong."

#: temp.glade:22110
msgid "Single Chapter Books"
msgstr "Buk Gat Wanpela Kapitel Tasol"

#: temp.glade:22115
msgid "Select this option to show the 1 at the beginning\n"
"of books that only have a single chapter (OBA, PHM,\n"
"2JN, 3JN, JUD, etc.)"
msgstr "Makim dispela opsen bilong soim namba 1 long stat\n"
"bilong ol buk i gat wanpela kapitel tasol (OBA, PHM,\n"
"2JN, 3JN, JUD, na isi moa)"

#: temp.glade:22131
msgid "Non-Scripture Books"
msgstr "Ol Buk i No Skripsa"

#: temp.glade:22136
msgid "Peripheral books often have more than one\n"
"\"chapter\" but do not need the chapter number\n"
"to be printed. By default, PTXprint removes\n"
"the chapter numbers from non-scripture books.\n"
"If you need it to retain (and show) those chapter\n"
"numbers then check this option."
msgstr "Ol peripheral buk i save gat moa long wanpela\n"
"\"kapitel\" tasol i no nid long printim namba bilong kapitel.\n"
"PTXprint i save rausim ol namba bilong kapitel\n"
"long ol buk i no Skripsa. Sapos yu laik i holim\n"
"(na soim) ol namba bilong kapitel, makim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:22189
msgid "The \\zglm style is used to format the\n"
"floor brackets used in glossary markup.\n"
"\n"
"Click to edit the marker's properties on the Styles tab."
msgstr "Stail \\zglm i save formatim ol floor bracket\n"
"ol i usim long glossary markup.\n"
"\n"
"Klikim long senisim ol propeti bilong marker long Styles tab."

#: temp.glade:22231
msgid "Other Features"
msgstr "Narapela Ol Pisa"

#: temp.glade:22250
msgid "Main settings to control the \n"
"beginning and ending of books,\n"
"and options for what should be\n"
"included in the Main Body of text.\n"
"Also settings for special books."
msgstr "Ol main seting bilong kontrolim stat\n"
"na pinis bilong ol buk,\n"
"na ol opsen bilong wanem samting i mas\n"
"inap long Main Body bilong tekst.\n"
"Taim tu, ol seting bilong ol spesel buk."

#: temp.glade:22256
msgid "Body"
msgstr "Body"

#: temp.glade:22310 temp.glade:23692
msgid "Show Callers in Notes Area"
msgstr "Soim Ol Caller long Hap bilong Ol Nout"

#: temp.glade:22316
msgid "Usually the \"Caller\" symbol is also shown\n"
"in the notes area which helps the reader \n"
"quickly find the footnote from the text."
msgstr "Planti taim ol \"Caller\" simbol i soim tu\n"
"long hap bilong ol nout, na dispela i helpim\n"
"rida long painim kwik ol futnout long tekst."

#: temp.glade:22332 temp.glade:23714
msgid "Reset Callers on Page"
msgstr "Stat Gen long Ol Caller long Peles"

#: temp.glade:22337 temp.glade:23719
msgid "If this is checked, then the sequence of \n"
"callers starts again from the 1st item in\n"
"the list of callers specified.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this feature doesn't always take\n"
"effect straight away. You may need to hit\n"
"Print a second time before it applies."
msgstr "Sapos dispela i makim, orait lain bilong ol\n"
"caller i stat gen long namba 1 long lis\n"
"bilong ol caller yu makim pinis.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim: dispela i no save wok kwik oltaim.\n"
"I ken mas yu klikim Print namba tu taim\n"
"bipo em i wok."

#: temp.glade:22363 temp.glade:23596
msgid "Show Callers\n"
"in the Text:"
msgstr "Soim Ol Caller\n"
"long Tekst:"

#: temp.glade:22369
msgid "A \"Caller\" is a symbol (in the text) which\n"
"alerts the reader that there is further\n"
"information (in this case a footnote\n"
"at the bottom of the page). Ideally, \n"
"the caller should be distinct from the\n"
"rest of the text, so a symbol works\n"
"well if supported by the font. Otherwise\n"
"the letters of the alphabet can be used.\n"
"\n"
"Separate callers with a comma (no spaces).\n"
"For example: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, etc.\n"
"or:  †,‡,§,∥,#    or: ✶,☆,✦,✪\n"
"\n"
"If you do not see the callers you are \n"
"expecting in the PDF, then try using \n"
"the \"Override...\" setting above.\n"
msgstr "\"Caller\" em wanpela simbol (long tekst) i\n"
"soim long rida olsem i gat moa save\n"
"(long dispela taim em wanpela futnout\n"
"long as bilong peles). Caller i mas narapela\n"
"long ol arapela hap tekst, olsem na simbol i gutpela\n"
"sapos font i sapotim. Sapos i no olsem,\n"
"i ken usim ol leta bilong alfabet.\n"
"\n"
"Pasim ol caller wantaim koma (nogat spes).\n"
"Pispela: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, na isi moa\n"
"o:  †,‡,§,∥,#    o: ✶,☆,✦,✪\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu no lukim ol caller yu\n"
"wetim long PDF, traim seting \"Override...\"\n"
"long antap.\n"

#: temp.glade:22404 temp.glade:23636
msgid "These callers should automatically be loaded from\n"
"the settings in the Paratext project, but can be\n"
"modified here if needed.\n"
"(Use the button on the right to reload them if needed.)\n"
"\n"
"Separate callers with a comma (no spaces).\n"
"For example: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, etc.\n"
"or:  †,‡,§,∥,#    or: ✶,☆,✦,✪"
msgstr "Ol dispela caller i mas kamap yet long ol\n"
"seting bilong Paratext projek, tasol yu ken\n"
"senisim long hia sapos i gat bikpela as.\n"
"(Yusim boton long sait bilong ol long loadim gen sapos i gat as.)\n"
"\n"
"Sapim ol caller wantaim koma (nogat spes).\n"
"Olsem: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, na isave.\n"
"o:  †,‡,§,∥,#    o: ✶,☆,✦,✪"

#: temp.glade:22428
msgid "Clicking this button will reload\n"
"the footnote callers from the\n"
"Paratext project settings.\n"
"\n"
"If the callers have not been defined \n"
"in the Paratext project, or are already\n"
"showing, then a default set will appear."
msgstr "Sapos yu klikim dispela boton, ol futnout caller\n"
"i kamap gen long ol seting bilong Paratext project.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos ol caller i no stap long Paratext project,\n"
"o i soim pinis, orait wanpela default set i kamap."

#: temp.glade:22460
msgid "Override hidden/automatic Footnote caller settings"
msgstr "Override ol hait/automatik seting bilong Futnout caller"

#: temp.glade:22465
msgid "The Footnotes specified in Paratext use\n"
"\\f +(plus) to cycle through the callers,\n"
"or \\f - (minus) to omit the caller.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is enabled, the Show Callers\n"
"settings below will override whatever\n"
"has been specified within the text itself."
msgstr "Ol Futnot long Paratext i yusim\n"
"\\f +(plus) long ol i go raun long ol caller,\n"
"o \\f - (minus) long rausim caller.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela opsen i op, ol Show Callers\n"
"seting aninit bai i winim wanem ol i makim\n"
"long tok yet."

#: temp.glade:22484 temp.glade:22485
msgid "Start Each Footnote on a New Line"
msgstr "Stat Olgeta Futnout long Nupela Lain"

#: temp.glade:22489
msgid "Normally footnotes are arranged one after\n"
"the other to form a block of text. But if you \n"
"require each footnote to start on its own new\n"
"line then set this option."
msgstr "Olgeta taim ol futnout i save stap wanpela bihain\n"
"long narapela olsem wanpela blok tekst. Tasol sapos yu\n"
"laik olgeta futnout i stat long nupela lain bilong em,\n"
"makim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:22511
msgid "Click to edit the Footnote properties on the Styles tab."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol propeti bilong Futnout long Styles tab."

#: lib/ptxprint/pdf_viewer.py:32
msgid "End of Book"
msgstr "Pinis bilong Buk"

#: temp.glade:22530
msgid "This option will prevent footnotes showing\n"
"on each page, but will gather them together\n"
"and place them all at the end of the book."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i stopim ol futnout long soim\n"
"long olgeta peles, tasol i bungim olgeta na\n"
"putim long pinis bilong buk."

#: temp.glade:22548 temp.glade:23478
msgid "End of Column"
msgstr "Pinis bilong Kolom"

#: temp.glade:22553
msgid "Use this option (only available in 2-column\n"
"layout) to show the footnotes at the end\n"
"of the 2nd column of text.\n"
"\n"
"Footnotes and cross-references at the foot of the\n"
"page are kept together, so changing this may also\n"
"change where the cross-references are placed."
msgstr "Yusim dispela opsen (i wok long 2-kolum\n"
"layout tasol) long soim ol futnot long pinis\n"
"bilong namba 2 kolum bilong tok.\n"
"\n"
"Ol futnot na ol cross-reference long as bilong\n"
"pes i stap wantaim, olsem na sapos yu senisim dispela,\n"
"plais bilong ol cross-reference tu inap senis."

#: temp.glade:22576 temp.glade:23506
msgid "End of Page"
msgstr "Pinis bilong Peles"

#: temp.glade:22581
msgid "Footnotes (and cross-references) are\n"
"usually placed at the end of each page.\n"
msgstr "Ol futnout (na ol kros-refrens) i save stap\n"
"long pinis bilong olgeta peles.\n"

#: temp.glade:22605
msgid "Placement of Footnotes:"
msgstr "Ples bilong Ol Futnout:"

#: temp.glade:22640 temp.glade:24801 temp.glade:25729
msgid "Space Below Rule (pt)"
msgstr "Spes Aninit long Rule (pt)"

#: temp.glade:22657 temp.glade:24818 temp.glade:25746
msgid "Space Above Rule (pt)"
msgstr "Spes Antap long Rule (pt)"

#: temp.glade:22672
msgid "The vertical space between the body text and the\n"
"area containing footnotes and cross-references.\n"
"\n"
"If the Footnote Rule is not shown, the vertical\n"
"space will still be calculated as the Space Above\n"
"plus the Space Below (the imaginary) Rule."
msgstr "Spes i go daun namel long tekst bilong bodi na\n"
"ples we ol futnot na ol kros-refrens i stap.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos Futnot Rule i no soim, spes i stap yet\n"
"na ol i kaunim olsem Spes Antap plus\n"
"Spes Aninit long (rule i no stap tru) Rule."

#: temp.glade:22679 temp.glade:25768
msgid "Space Separating\n"
"Text From Notes:"
msgstr "Spes i Brukim\n"
"Tekst long Ol Nout:"

#: temp.glade:22692
msgid "The vertical space between the main\n"
"text body and the footnote rule.\n"
"\n"
"Note: if you make this value less than the descenders\n"
"of the last lines of text, then the footnotes will push\n"
"down into the footer area. If you see this happening,\n"
"increase this value to trigger an earlier page break to\n"
"solve the problem."
msgstr "Spes i go daun namel long main\n"
"tekst na futnot rule.\n"
"\n"
"Smail toktok: sapos yu mekim dispela namba i liklik\n"
"long ol ples bilong ol tel bilong ol las lain tekst, orait\n"
"ol futnot bai pusim i go daun long ples bilong footer.\n"
"Sapos yu lukim dispela, bikpela moa dispela namba\n"
"bilong kamapim pes brek isi na stretim dispela hevi."

#: temp.glade:22720
msgid "This is the vertical space/gap (pts) between\n"
"the rule and the footnotes."
msgstr "Dispela em spes/gap (pts) namel long\n"
"rule na ol futnot."

#: temp.glade:22755 temp.glade:22756
msgid "Show Footnote Rule"
msgstr "Soim Futnot Rule"

#: temp.glade:22760
msgid "This is the horizontal rule separating\n"
"the body text from the footnote area."
msgstr "Dispela em horizontal rule i brukim\n"
"tekst bilong bodi long ples bilong ol futnot."

#: temp.glade:22792 temp.glade:25519
msgid "Distance (mm) to move the rule in from the side\n"
"chosen in Horizontal Position."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) bilong pusim rule i kam insait\n"
"long sait yu makim long Horizontal Position."

#: temp.glade:22813 temp.glade:25540
msgid "The length of the rule as a percentage\n"
"of the column/page width."
msgstr "Longpela bilong rule olsem pesentis\n"
"bilong wait bilong kolum/pes."

#: temp.glade:22835 temp.glade:25562
msgid "The thickness of the rule."
msgstr "Bikpela bilong rule."

#: temp.glade:22858 temp.glade:25585
msgid "Which side of the column the rule is aligned to:\n"
"Left, Right, Center, Inner (spine side) or Outer.\n"
"Inner and Outer swap sides on odd and even pages.\n"
"This only matters when the Length is less than 100%."
msgstr "Rule i stap long wanem sait bilong kolum:\n"
"Left, Right, Center, Inner (sait bilong spine) o Outer.\n"
"Inner na Outer i senisim sait long ol odd na even pes.\n"
"Dispela i wok tasol taim Length i liklik long 100%."

#: temp.glade:22883 temp.glade:25058 temp.glade:25610
msgid "Indent (mm)"
msgstr "Indent (mm)"

#: temp.glade:22900 temp.glade:25075 temp.glade:25627
msgid "Length (% of col)"
msgstr "Longpela (% bilong kolum)"

#: temp.glade:22916 temp.glade:25091 temp.glade:25643
msgid "Thickness (pt)"
msgstr "Bikpela (pt)"

#: lib/ptxprint/pdf_viewer.py:68
msgid "Horizontal Position"
msgstr "Horizontal Ples"

#: temp.glade:22946 temp.glade:25121 temp.glade:25673
msgid "These settings control the rule (horizontal line)\n"
"above the notes: its indent (mm), its length\n"
"(% of the column width), its thickness (pt) and\n"
"which side of the column it is aligned to."
msgstr "Ol dispela seting i kontrolim rule (horizontal lain)\n"
"antap long ol nots: indent bilong en (mm), longpela bilong en\n"
"(% bilong bikpela bilong kolum), tiknes bilong en (pt) na\n"
"wanem sait bilong kolum em i stap long en."

#: temp.glade:22951 temp.glade:25126 temp.glade:25678
msgid "Rule Positioning\n"
"and Parameters:"
msgstr "Ples na Ol Parameta\n"
"bilong Rule:"

#: temp.glade:22982 temp.glade:25157 temp.glade:25832
msgid "Rule and Space Settings"
msgstr "Ol Seting bilong Rule na Spes"

#: temp.glade:22998 temp.glade:22999
msgid "Include Footnotes"
msgstr "Putim Ol Futnot"

#: temp.glade:23004
msgid "Select whether footnotes should \n"
"be included.\n"
"\n"
"The specific settings for these are\n"
"located on the Footnotes tab."
msgstr "Makim sapos ol futnot i mas stap.\n"
"\n"
"Ol seting bilong ol i stap\n"
"long tab bilong Futnot."

#: temp.glade:23036
msgid "Only show verse numbers from \\fr"
msgstr "Soim namba bilong ves tasol long \\fr"

#: temp.glade:23040
msgid "The footnote reference \\fr usually\n"
"includes the chapter & verse number\n"
"like this 3:16. If you prefer to hide the\n"
"chapter, so that only 16 is shown, then\n"
"enable this option."
msgstr "Futnot refrens \\fr i save garim\n"
"namba bilong kapitel na ves\n"
"olsem 3:16. Sapos yu laik haitim\n"
"kapitel, na 16 tasol i soim, orait\n"
"opim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:23058 temp.glade:23946
msgid "Side Margin"
msgstr "Sait Margin"

#: temp.glade:23063
msgid "This option will place footnotes (and optionally \n"
"also the Cross-references and Section Headings) \n"
"in a column next to the text and align them as\n"
"closely as possible vertically to their caller. "
msgstr "Dispela opsen bai putim ol futnot (na sapos yu laik,\n"
"ol Kros-refrens na Ol Hedin bilong Sekson tu)\n"
"long wanpela kolum klostu long tekst na stretim ol\n"
"olsem klostu olsem i ken long kolar bilong ol. "

#: temp.glade:23125
msgid "Add a Colon ':' After \\fq and \\xq"
msgstr "Putim Kolon ':' Bihain long \\fq na \\xq"

#: temp.glade:23130
msgid "Some projects prefer to separate the\n"
"Quoted text from the footnote text\n"
"with a colon ':' which helps keep the\n"
"elements visually distinct."
msgstr "Sampela projek i laik skelim tekst\n"
"bilong Kot long tekst bilong futnot\n"
"wantaim kolon ':' we i helpim ol\n"
"part i kamap klia long ai."

#: temp.glade:23147 temp.glade:23148
msgid "Keep Book Names and Refs Together"
msgstr "Holim Nem bilong Buk na Ol Ref i Stap Wantaim"

#: temp.glade:23152
msgid "This option inserts a space that discourages line\n"
"breaks between the book name and the Ch:Vs refs\n"
"so that they don't get split across lines.\n"
"\n"
"It also prevents single letters being left at\n"
"the end of a line in note text.\n"
"\n"
"Note:  This setting currently has no effect on\n"
"cross-references imported from external lists."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i putim wanpela spes i no laikim lain\n"
"brek namel long nem bilong buk na ol Ch:Vs ref\n"
"olsem na ol i no bruk long ol lain.\n"
"\n"
"Em i stopim tu ol wanpela leta i stap long\n"
"pinis bilong lain long tok bilong not.\n"
"\n"
"Not:  Dispela seting i no wok yet long ol\n"
"cross-reference ol i kisim long ol arapela lis."

#: temp.glade:23175 temp.glade:23176
msgid "Show All Glossary Entries as Footnotes"
msgstr "Soim Olgeta Glossary Entri olsem Futnot"

#: temp.glade:23180
msgid "Glossary entries for ALL marked-up\n"
"Biblical Terms on each page can be\n"
"made to appear as footnotes.\n"
"\n"
"Glossary words are marked like \\w word\\w*\n"
"in the USFM text file. Only the first paragraph\n"
"of each glossary entry is used.\n"
"\n"
"This feature is extremely useful when\n"
"producing printouts for comprehension\n"
"testing (where  Key Biblical Terms in the\n"
"passage which have Glossary Entries also\n"
"need to be checked for understanding)."
msgstr "Ol Glossary entry bilong OLGETA mak-im\n"
"Biblical Terms long wanwan pes inap\n"
"kamap olsem ol futnot.\n"
"\n"
"Ol glossary tok i gat mak olsem \\w word\\w*\n"
"long USFM tok fail. Namba wan paragraf tasol\n"
"bilong wanwan glossary entry i kamap.\n"
"\n"
"Dispela i helpim tumas taim yu wokim ol printim\n"
"long comprehension testing (we ol Key Biblical Terms\n"
"long rot i gat Glossary Entries tu\n"
"i mas ol i skelim long ol i andastanim)."

#: temp.glade:23206
msgid "The horizontal space between notes that are being\n"
"run together as a single paragraph can be set here. \n"
"The default space is calculated as 33% between \n"
"min & max values.\n"
"\n"
"For example if min=6pt and max=15pt then the \n"
"default horizontal space between notes would be 9pt.\n"
"\n"
"If this control is disabled, it is because both the\n"
"Footnotes and Cross-References have been set\n"
"to start on a new line. (see \\f and \\x settings above)."
msgstr "Yu ken makim hia spes i go sait long sait namel long ol nout i stap wanpela paragraf.\n"
"Spes bilong default i kamap 33% namel long min na maks vailu.\n"
"\n"
"Olsem, sapos min=6pt na maks=15pt, orait default spes i go sait long sait namel long ol nout em 9pt.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela kontrol i no save wok, em bilong wanem Futnot na Kros-refrens i gat seting long stat long nupela lain. (Lukim ol seting bilong \\f na \\x antap.)"

#: temp.glade:23218
msgid "Horizontal Space\n"
"Separating Notes:"
msgstr "Spes i Go Sait long Sait\n"
"Namel long Ol Nout:"

#: temp.glade:23231
msgid "This spacing is set in points (pts). Changing this will \n"
"increase or decrease the MINIMUM horizontal space\n"
"between notes that have been run together."
msgstr "Spes dispela i stap long pointim (pts). Sapos yu senisim, MINIMUM spes i go sait long sait\n"
"namel long ol nout i stap wanpela paragraf bai i kamap bikpela o liklik."

#: temp.glade:23259
msgid "This spacing is set in points (pts). Changing this will \n"
"increase or decrease the MAXIMUM horizontal space\n"
"between notes that have been run together."
msgstr "Spes dispela i stap long pointim (pts). Sapos yu senisim, MAKSIMUM spes i go sait long sait\n"
"namel long ol nout i stap wanpela paragraf bai i kamap bikpela o liklik."

#: temp.glade:23289
msgid "Minimum Space (pt)"
msgstr "Minimum Spes (pt)"

#: temp.glade:23306
msgid "Maximum Space (pt)"
msgstr "Maksimum Spes (pt)"

#: temp.glade:23321 temp.glade:23346
msgid "When Footnotes and Cross-references are not blended\n"
"together in the same block then the Footnotes appear\n"
"in one block and the Cross-references in another block \n"
"just below them. This setting (pts) lets you adjust the \n"
"vertical space between these two sections."
msgstr "Sapos Futnot na Kros-refrens i no joinim long wanpela blok, orait Futnot i stap long wanpela blok na Kros-refrens i stap long narapela blok i stap daunbilo long ol. Dispela seting (pts) i larim yu senisim spes i go antap na daun namel long dispela tupela hap."

#: temp.glade:23353
msgid "Vertical Space Between\n"
"Footnotes and xRefs (pt):"
msgstr "Spes i Go Antap na Daun Namel\n"
"long Futnot na xRef (pt):"

#: temp.glade:23405
msgid "Miscellaneous Footnote Settings"
msgstr "Ol Narapela Seting bilong Futnot"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:60 lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:106 lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:107 lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:108 lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:109
msgid "Footnotes"
msgstr "Futnot"

#: temp.glade:23460
msgid "This option will prevent cross-references showing\n"
"on each page, but will gather them together\n"
"and place them all at the end of the book."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i no larim ol kros-refrens i kamap long olgeta pes, tasol bai i bungim ol na putim ol olgeta long las bilong buk."

#: temp.glade:23483
msgid "Use this option (only available in 2-column\n"
"layout) to show the cross-references at the end\n"
"of the 2nd column of text.\n"
"\n"
"Footnotes and cross-references at the foot of the\n"
"page are kept together, so changing this may also\n"
"change where the footnotes are placed."
msgstr "Yusim dispela opsen (i wok long 2-kolum\n"
"layout tasol) long soim ol cross-reference long pinis\n"
"bilong namba 2 kolum bilong tok.\n"
"\n"
"Ol futnot na ol cross-reference long as bilong\n"
"pes i stap wantaim, olsem na sapos yu senisim dispela,\n"
"plais bilong ol futnot tu inap senis."

#: temp.glade:23511
msgid "Cross-references are usually placed \n"
"at the end of each page."
msgstr "Ol kros-refrens i save stap long las bilong olgeta pes."

#: temp.glade:23534
msgid "Placement of Cross-References:"
msgstr "Ples bilong Ol Kros-refrens:"

#: temp.glade:23544 temp.glade:23545
msgid "Start Each Cross-Reference on a New Line"
msgstr "Stratim Olgeta Kros-refrens long Nupela Lain"

#: temp.glade:23549
msgid "Normally cross-references are arranged one after\n"
"the other to form a block of text. But if you \n"
"require each cross-reference to start on its own new\n"
"line then set this option."
msgstr "Olgeta taim ol kros-refrens i save kamap wanpela biihain long narapela na i mekim wanpela blok bilong tok. Tasol sapos yu laik olgeta kros-refrens i stat long nupela lain bilong em yet, orait makim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:23566
msgid "Override hidden/automatic Cross-reference caller settings"
msgstr "Tromoi seting bilong kolar bilong kros-refrens i haid/otomatik"

#: temp.glade:23571
msgid "Cross-references specified in Paratext use\n"
"\\x +(plus) to cycle through the callers,\n"
"or \\x - (minus) to omit the caller.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is enabled, the Show Callers\n"
"settings below will override whatever\n"
"has been specified within the text itself."
msgstr "Ol kros-refrens long Paratext i save yusim\n"
"\\x + (plus) long ron long ol kolar,\n"
"o \\x - (minus) long rausim kolar.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela opsen i op, ol seting bilong Soim Ol Kolar\n"
"i stap daunbilo bai i winim wanem samting i stap pinis\n"
"long tok yet."

#: temp.glade:23603
msgid "A \"Caller\" is a symbol (in the text) which\n"
"alerts the reader that there is further\n"
"information (in this case a cross-reference\n"
"at the bottom of the page). Some people\n"
"prefer not to indicate cross-references in\n"
"the text itself, but just to include them at\n"
"the bottom of the page.\n"
"\n"
"Separate callers with a comma (no spaces).\n"
"For example: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, etc.\n"
"or:  †,‡,§,∥,#    or: ✶,☆,✦,✪\n"
"\n"
"If you do not see the callers you are \n"
"expecting in the PDF, then try using \n"
"the \"Override...\" setting above."
msgstr "Wanpela \"Kolar\" em i wanpela mak (long tok) i save tokim man i ritim long i gat moa save (long dispela taim, wanpela kros-refrens long as bilong pes). Sampela i no laik soim kros-refrens long tok yet, tasol putim tasol long as bilong pes.\n"
"\n"
"Haptaim ol kolar long koma (i no gat spes).\n"
"Olsem: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, na isi.\n"
"o: †,‡,§,∥,#    o: ✶,☆,✦,✪\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu no lukim ol kolar yu laik lukim long PDF, orait traim seting \"Tromoi...\" antap."

#: temp.glade:23660
msgid "Clicking this button will reload\n"
"the cross-ref callers from the\n"
"Paratext project settings.\n"
"\n"
"If the callers have not been defined \n"
"in the Paratext project, or are already\n"
"showing, then a default set will appear."
msgstr "Sapos yu klikim dispela boton, bai ol kolar bilong kros-refrens i kam bek\n"
"long ol seting bilong Paratext projek.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos ol kolar i no stap long Paratext projek, o i soim pinis, orait wanpela set bilong default bai i kamap."

#: temp.glade:23698
msgid "Usually the \"Caller\" symbol is also shown\n"
"in the notes area which helps the reader \n"
"quickly find the cross-reference from the text."
msgstr "Planti taim \"Kolar\" mak i save kamap tu long hap bilong ol nout, na dispela i helpim man i ritim long painim kros-refrens long tok isi."

#: temp.glade:23744
msgid "Click to edit the Cross-Reference properties on the Styles tab."
msgstr "Klikim bilong senisim ol seting bilong Kros-refrens long Styles tab."

#: temp.glade:23758
msgid "Below Footnotes"
msgstr "Daunbilo long Futnot"

#: temp.glade:23763
msgid "Cross-references will be listed in a separate block\n"
"underneath the footnotes (rather than combined\n"
"along with the footnotes as a single paragraph)."
msgstr "Ol kros-refrens bai i stap long wanpela blok i narapela, daunbilo long ol futnot (i no joinim wantaim ol futnot olsem wanpela paragraf)."

#: temp.glade:23781
msgid "Blend with Footnotes"
msgstr "Joinim wantaim Futnot"

#: temp.glade:23786
msgid "To save space in the footnote area, you can\n"
"combine the  footnotes and cross-references\n"
"as a single paragraph (rather than the cross-\n"
"references appearing in a separate block\n"
"underneath the footnotes). If this option is\n"
"used, the Cross-References can only have\n"
"one type of caller (rather than a sequence)\n"
"which must be specified above."
msgstr "Bilong sevim ples long hap bilong not, yu ken\n"
"kombainim ol not na ol kros-refrens\n"
"i stap olsem wanpela paragraf (i no olsem ol kros-\n"
"refrens i stap long narapela blok\n"
"astap long ol not). Sapos yu usim dispela opsen,\n"
"ol Kros-Refrens i ken gat wanpela kain\n"
"kola tasol (i no wanpela lain kola) na yu mas makim\n"
"long antap."

#: temp.glade:23809 temp.glade:24745
msgid "Column Cross-References"
msgstr "Kolum Kros-Refrens"

#: temp.glade:23815
msgid "When there are numerous cross-references (usually\n"
"when using an external list of references) then it\n"
"may be useful to place them in their own column. \n"
"\n"
"The cross references will appear in a narrow vertical\n"
"column similar to a study/reference Bible layout."
msgstr "Sapos i gat planti kros-refrens (olsem\n"
"sapos yu usim wanpela lis bilong ol refrens i stap\n"
"long narapela hap), orait inap gutpela long putim ol\n"
"long kolum bilong ol yet.\n"
"\n"
"Ol kros-refrens bai i kamap long wanpela\n"
"narouwa kolum i go daun, olsem long\n"
"Baibel bilong stadi o refrens."

#: temp.glade:23837 temp.glade:23838
msgid "Use External List of Cross-References"
msgstr "Usim Lis Bilong Ol Kros-Refrens i Stap Narapela Hap"

#: temp.glade:23842
msgid "Instead of using a handful of cross-references\n"
"as specified within the project's USFM text, you\n"
"can select an external list containing many 1000's\n"
"of cross-references. These will automatically be\n"
"localized into the project's language using the\n"
"\\toc3 values specified in the Paratext project\n"
"settings (See: Scripture reference settings...)\n"
"\n"
"This feature is usually used for Study or\n"
"Reference Bibles in conjunction with the \n"
"'Column Cross-References' placement option."
msgstr "Bambai long usim sampela kros-refrens tasol\n"
"olsem i stap long USFM tekst bilong projek, yu\n"
"ken makim wanpela lis i gat planti tausen\n"
"kros-refrens. Ol bai i senis long tokples bilong\n"
"projek yet long usim ol \\toc3 velu i stap long\n"
"ol seting bilong Paratext projek (Lukim: Scripture reference settings...)\n"
"\n"
"Ol i save usim dispela long ol Baibel bilong Stadi o\n"
"Refrens wantaim opsen bilong putim ol\n"
"'Kolum Kros-Refrens'."

#: temp.glade:23866 temp.glade:23867
msgid "Show Extended Cross-References"
msgstr "Soim Ol Longpela Kros-Refrens"

#: temp.glade:23871
msgid "Study Bibles can (optionally) use extended\n"
"cross-references (\\ex) which can be displayed\n"
"along with other kinds of cross-references."
msgstr "Ol Baibel bilong Stadi i ken (sapos yu laik) usim ol longpela\n"
"kros-refrens (\\ex) na ol i ken kamap\n"
"wantaim ol narapela kain kros-refrens."

#: temp.glade:23886
msgid "Include Cross-References (From Project Text)"
msgstr "Putim Ol Kros-Refrens (Long Tekst Bilong Projek)"

#: temp.glade:23892
msgid "Select whether cross-references from\n"
"the project's text should be included.\n"
"\n"
"The specific settings for these are\n"
"located on the Cross-References tab."
msgstr "Makim sapos yu laik putim ol kros-refrens\n"
"bilong tekst bilong projek.\n"
"\n"
"Ol seting bilong ol i stap\n"
"long tab bilong Kros-Refrens."

#: temp.glade:23913
msgid "Only show verse numbers from \\xo"
msgstr "Soim namba bilong ves tasol long \\xo"

#: temp.glade:23917
msgid "The cross-reference origin \\xo usually\n"
"includes the chapter & verse number\n"
"like this 3:16. If you prefer to hide the\n"
"chapter, so that only 16 is shown, then\n"
"enable this option."
msgstr "\\xo, i makim we kros-refrens i kamap, save\n"
"inkludim namba bilong kapitel na ves\n"
"olsem 3:16. Sapos yu laik hait long kapitel, na\n"
"namba 16 tasol i kamap, orait\n"
"opim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:23951
msgid "This option will place references (and optionally \n"
"also the Footnotes and Section Headings) \n"
"in a column next to the text and align them as\n"
"closely as possible vertically to their caller. "
msgstr "Dispela opsen bai putim ol refrens (na sapos yu laik, ol\n"
"not na ol het bilong sekson tu)\n"
"long wanpela kolum arere long tekst na lainim ol\n"
"inap long wanem i klostu long kola bilong ol. "

#: temp.glade:24014 temp.glade:24045
msgid "The various cross-reference lists often contain\n"
"hundreds of 1000s of references. You may want\n"
"to only include target references that are\n"
"currently available to your readers by \n"
"selecting a subset of Biblical books.\n"
"\n"
"So for example, if there is no Old Testament \n"
"yet, you may want to only include target \n"
"cross-references to NT Books.\n"
"\n"
"If you select Books in \"This Publication\", \n"
"then only cross-references targeting \n"
"books in the \"Portions or Multiple Books\"\n"
"list on the Basic tab will be included."
msgstr "Ol cross-reference lis i save gat\n"
"handet na tausen ol ref. Maski yu laik putim\n"
"ol target ref tasol ol rida bilong yu i gat pinis,\n"
"yu ken makim sampela buk bilong Baibel.\n"
"\n"
"Olsem, sapos Olpela Testamen i no stap\n"
"yet, yu ken putim ol target cross-reference\n"
"long ol NT Buk tasol.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu makim ol Buk long \"This Publication\",\n"
"ol cross-reference tasol i go long ol buk\n"
"long lis \"Portions or Multiple Books\"\n"
"long Basic tab bai i stap."

#: temp.glade:24029
msgid "Include Refs\n"
"for Books in:"
msgstr "Putim Ol Refrens\n"
"bilong Ol Buk long:"

#: temp.glade:24078
msgid "External Refs:"
msgstr "Ol Refrens i Stap Narapela Hap:"

#: temp.glade:24093
msgid "There are multiple options to choose\n"
"from if you wish to use an external list\n"
"of cross-references. Select whichever\n"
"is most appropriate and the list will\n"
"automatically be localized to use the\n"
"abbreviated book names as defined in\n"
"Paratext's Scripture Reference Settings\n"
"which should match the \\toc3 markers.\n"
"\n"
"The five Standard list sizes take fewer or more\n"
"references from the same prioritized list\n"
"(fewest = only the most important ones)."
msgstr "I gat planti opsen long makim sapos yu laik\n"
"yusim wanpela arapela lis bilong ol\n"
"cross-reference. Makim wanpela i gutpela tumas\n"
"na lis bai i senis yet long yusim ol\n"
"sotpela nem bilong ol buk olsem Paratext's Scripture\n"
"Reference Settings i makim, i mas wankain\n"
"wantaim ol \\toc3 mak.\n"
"\n"
"Ol faiv Standard lis saiz i kisim liklik o planti\n"
"ref long wanpela lis i gat namba wan na namba tu\n"
"(fewest = ol i bikpela tumas tasol)."

#: temp.glade:24144
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Standet"

#: temp.glade:24149
msgid "The Standard List contains more \n"
"than 340,000 cross-references\n"
"which have been prioritized by\n"
"crowd-sourcing."
msgstr "Standet Lis i gat Moa\n"
"long 340,000 kros-refrens\n"
"ol i makim pastaim long wei bilong\n"
"samting planti manmeri i helpim."

#: temp.glade:24167
msgid "Strongs"
msgstr "Strongs"

#: temp.glade:24172
msgid "The Strong's List contains a curated\n"
"subset of cross-references generated\n"
"from the Strong's Numbers. Optionally\n"
"an index for these numbers can also\n"
"be created as an additional book that\n"
"can be appended to the publication.\n"
"\n"
"Each set of cross-references is indexed\n"
"by a Hebrew or Greek Strong's number\n"
"which can be looked up in the (optional)\n"
"Index which can be generated using the\n"
"\"Generate Index...\" button."
msgstr "Strong's Lis i gat wanpela sampela bilong ol kros-refrens\n"
"ol i makim gut, ol i kamap\n"
"long ol Strong's Namba. Sapos yu laik,\n"
"yu ken mekim wanpela indeks bilong ol dispela namba olsem\n"
"wanpela buk moa i ken i go wantaim\n"
"buk bilong yu.\n"
"\n"
"Ol kros-refrens i stap long indeks\n"
"bilong wanpela Hibru o Grik Strong's namba\n"
"yu ken painim long (opsen) Indeks, em yu ken\n"
"mekim long boton \"Generate Index...\"."

#: temp.glade:24199
msgid "TSK"
msgstr "TSK"

#: temp.glade:24204
msgid "For generations, the Treasury of Scripture Knowledge\n"
"has been an enduring cross-reference resource for Bible\n"
"students worldwide. This highly respected and nearly\n"
"exhaustive compilation of cross-references was developed\n"
"by R.A. Torrey from references in the Rev. Thomas Scott's\n"
"Commentary and the Comprehensive Bible. With nearly\n"
"500,000 cross-references it is the most thorough source\n"
"available."
msgstr "Longpela taim, Treasury of Scripture Knowledge\n"
"i stap wanpela gutpela kros-refrens samting bilong ol\n"
"student bilong Baibel long olgeta hap. Dispela lis ol manmeri i lukim i gutpela tru na klostu olgeta\n"
"R.A. Torrey i mekim long ol refrens i stap long Commentary\n"
"bilong Rev. Thomas Scott na Comprehensive Bible. Wantaim klostu\n"
"500,000 kros-refrens, em i gutpela moa\n"
"long olgeta."

#: temp.glade:24228
msgid "BibWrx"
msgstr "BibWrx"

#: temp.glade:24233
msgid "The BibleWorks list contains 112,000 cross-references\n"
"which were formerly part of the BibleWorks software\n"
"which has been discontinued."
msgstr "BibleWorks lis i gat 112,000 kros-refrens\n"
"ol i bin stap long BibleWorks soptwia\n"
"olsem i pinis nau."

#: temp.glade:24252
msgid "UBS"
msgstr "UBS"

#: temp.glade:24257
msgid "This list contains New Testament and Old Testament\n"
"references (NO Deuterocanonical  references). Short\n"
"Bible Reference System, edited by Robert G. Bratcher,\n"
"(c) 1961 United Bible Societies. This list was used in\n"
"GNT92. Organizations that have a Paratext license may\n"
"use this list in their publication without attribution or\n"
"notifying UBS. All other rights to use this list are reserved.\n"
"\n"
"Use the (DC) list if Deutero Canonical references are needed."
msgstr "Dispela lis i gat ol refrens bilong Nupela Testamen na Olpela Testamen\n"
"(NO gat ol Deuterocanonical refrens). Short\n"
"Bible Reference System, Robert G. Bratcher i edit,\n"
"(c) 1961 United Bible Societies. Ol i usim dispela lis long\n"
"GNT92. Ol oganaisesen i gat Paratext laisens i ken\n"
"usim dispela lis long buk bilong ol i no ken tok orait o\n"
"tokim UBS. Olgeta narapela rait long usim dispela lis i stap.\n"
"\n"
"Usim (DC) lis sapos yu nidim ol Deutero Canonical refrens."

#: lib/ptxprint/pdf_viewer.py:73
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Kastam"

#: temp.glade:24284
msgid "You can select a specially-curated list of cross-references.\n"
"For example, it is possible to extract cross-references from\n"
"another project (in the .xrf file format) to be included here.\n"
"There is also an .xre format (extended .xrf) and an .xml\n"
"format which can be used as external cross-references.\n"
"These formats are explained in the documentation.\n"
"See the PTXprint documentation (xrefs.md)."
msgstr "Yu ken makim wanpela lis bilong ol cross-reference ol i redim gut.\n"
"Olsem, yu ken kisim ol cross-reference long\n"
"narapela projek (long .xrf fail format) na putim long hia.\n"
"I gat tu .xre format (bikpela .xrf) na .xml\n"
"format yu ken yusim olsem ol arapela cross-reference.\n"
"Ol dispela format i stap long dokumen.\n"
"Lukim PTXprint dokumen (xrefs.md)."

#: temp.glade:24336
msgid "Show Numbers in the Text"
msgstr "Soim Namba long Tekst"

#: temp.glade:24341
msgid "If the project's Biblical Terms list includes\n"
"renderings, then it is possible to show\n"
"Strong's numbers in the text itself, which\n"
"should make it easier to look up the\n"
"appropriate cross-references for a word\n"
"in a Study Bible.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this option is disabled by default\n"
"as it can clutter the scripture text and will\n"
"also slow down the production of the PDF."
msgstr "Sapos Biblical Terms lis bilong projek i gat\n"
"ol renderings, orait i gat rot long soim\n"
"ol Strong's namba long tok yet, na dispela\n"
"i ken mekim isi long painim ol cross-reference\n"
"bilong wanpela tok long wanpela Study Baibel.\n"
"\n"
"Lukim, dispela opsen i no op long stat\n"
"bikos em i ken mekim Skripsa tok i pas\n"
"na slo tu long wokim PDF."

#: temp.glade:24364
msgid "Show Numbers in Cross-References"
msgstr "Soim Namba long Ol Kros-Refrens"

#: temp.glade:24369
msgid "If you are generating a localized Strong's\n"
"index, then it is highly recommended to\n"
"include the Strong's numbers in the list \n"
"of cross-references in the text.\n"
"\n"
"But if you only want to show the references\n"
"without any Strong's numbers, then uncheck\n"
"this option for a more compact list."
msgstr "Sapos yu kamapim wanpela Strong's indeks long tok ples,\n"
"yumi tok strong olsem yu putim ol Strong's namba\n"
"long lista bilong ol kros-refrens long tekst.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos yu laik soim ol refrens tasol,\n"
"na no ol Strong's namba, kliarim dispela\n"
"opsen bilong mekim lista i liklik."

#: temp.glade:24390
msgid "Generate Index..."
msgstr "Kamapim Indeks..."

#: temp.glade:24395
msgid "For Strong's Cross References to be most useful,\n"
"it is recommended to include an Index at the\n"
"end of the publication. Click this button to set\n"
"various options to be used to generate the index."
msgstr "Bilong ol Strong's Kros Refrens i ken helpim yu moa,\n"
"yumi tok strong olsem yu putim wanpela Indeks\n"
"long las bilong buk. Klikim dispela boton long makim\n"
"ol opsen bilong kamapim indeks."

#: temp.glade:24411
msgid "Show All Occurrences"
msgstr "Soim Olgeta Taim"

#: temp.glade:24416
msgid "If a particular word occurs more than once\n"
"in the given verse, each occurrence will be\n"
"tagged with the Strong's number. If a word \n"
"matches more than one Strong's number\n"
"then both will be displayed.\n"
"\n"
"This may be rather confusing for the reader,\n"
"but could be helpful for a consultant to easily\n"
"identify overlap issues with the project's\n"
"Biblical terms renderings."
msgstr "Sapos wanpela tok i kamap mobeta long wanpela taim\n"
"long dispela ves, olgeta taim i kamap bai i gat\n"
"Strong's namba. Sapos wanpela tok i stret\n"
"wantaim mobeta long wanpela Strong's namba,\n"
"bai tupela i soim.\n"
"\n"
"Dispela inap mekim ol man bilong ridim i no klia gut,\n"
"tasol inap helpim wanpela konsaltan long painim isi\n"
"ol hap we ol tok i bung long ol Biblical terms\n"
"bilong dispela projek."

#: temp.glade:24443
msgid "Click to edit the Strong's 4 digit cell number properties on the Styles tab."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol seting bilong Strong's 4 digit cell long tab bilong Styles."

#: temp.glade:24469
msgid "Strong's References"
msgstr "Ol Strong's Refrens"

#: temp.glade:24509
msgid "\t"
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:24554
msgid "This sets the width of the centre column in points.\n"
"Note that 72pts is 1 inch, and increasing the size\n"
"here will decrease the amount of space available\n"
"for the 2 columns of scripture text.\n"
"\n"
"Consider using a larger page size if you want to\n"
"use Centre Column xRefs.\n"
"\n"
"If this centre column isn't wide enough to fit\n"
"the references, then you should also consider\n"
"reducing the size of the \\x font (to approx 6pt)."
msgstr "Dispela i makim bikpela bilong namel kolum long points.\n"
"Tingim olsem 72pts i wanpela inch, na sapos yu mekim\n"
"bikpela moa long hia, hap bilong tupela kolum bilong\n"
"Skripsa tekst bai i liklik.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik yusim Centre Column xRefs, tingim long\n"
"yusim bikpela saiz bilong pes.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela namel kolum i no brot inap long holim\n"
"ol refrens, tingim tu long mekim liklik saiz bilong \\x font\n"
"(klostu long 6pt)."

#: temp.glade:24588
msgid "Column Width (pts):"
msgstr "Brot bilong Kolum (pts):"

#: temp.glade:24600
msgid "Gutter Width (pts):"
msgstr "Brot bilong Gutter (pts):"

#: temp.glade:24612
msgid "This sets the space between the main body\n"
"text and the column of cross-references."
msgstr "Dispela i makim hap i stap namel long\n"
"main tekst na kolum bilong ol kros-refrens."

#: temp.glade:24638
msgid "Side of page:"
msgstr "Sait bilong pes:"

#: temp.glade:24652
msgid "Select where the column of cross-references\n"
"should be located on the page. Note that the\n"
"2-column layout insists on the cross-references\n"
"being positioned between the columns of text."
msgstr "Makim we kolum bilong ol kros-refrens\n"
"i mas stap long pes. Tingim olsem\n"
"2-kolum layout i mas putim ol kros-refrens\n"
"namel long ol kolum bilong tekst."

#: temp.glade:24671
msgid "Vertical Rule(s) Between Columns"
msgstr "Vertikal Rul Namel long Ol Kolum"

#: temp.glade:24676
msgid "Check this option to include a vertical line\n"
"separating the text and cross-references."
msgstr "Makim dispela opsen long putim wanpela vertikal\n"
"lain i brukim tekst na ol kros-refrens."

#: temp.glade:24693
msgid "Fill Upward From Bottom of Column"
msgstr "Pulim Antap Stat long Daunbilo bilong Kolum"

#: temp.glade:24698
msgid "If there are only a small number of\n"
"cross-references, it may appear better\n"
"for them to be placed nearer the end\n"
"(or bottom) of the page. Check this\n"
"option if you prefer the references to\n"
"fill the column upward from the end\n"
"of the page. "
msgstr "Sapos i gat liklik namba tasol bilong\n"
"kros-refrens, inap gutpela sapos ol i stap klostu\n"
"long las (o daunbilo) bilong pes. Makim\n"
"dispela opsen sapos yu laik ol refrens i\n"
"Pulim kolum i go antap stat long las\n"
"bilong pes. "

#: temp.glade:24719
msgid "Side Align Notes"
msgstr "Sait Alain Nots"

#: temp.glade:24724
msgid "For side column notes, should\n"
"the text of the notes align to \n"
"the edge of the main text?"
msgstr "Long ol nots long sait kolum, ating tekst\n"
"bilong ol nots i mas alain long\n"
"edj bilong main tekst?"

#: temp.glade:24761
msgid "Source for References"
msgstr "Ples Bilong Ol Refrens"

#: temp.glade:24831
msgid "Show Cross-Reference Rule"
msgstr "Soim Rul bilong Kros-Refrens"

#: temp.glade:24836
msgid "This is the horizontal rule separating the\n"
"body text from the cross-reference area.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Dispela em i horizontal rule i brukim\n"
"body tok long hap bilong cross-reference.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: temp.glade:24857
msgid "The vertical space between the body text and the\n"
"area containing cross-references.\n"
"\n"
"If the Cross-Reference Rule is not shown, the vertical\n"
"space will still be calculated as the Space Above\n"
"plus the Space Below (the imaginary) Rule."
msgstr "Ples antap na daun namel long body tok na\n"
"hap i gat ol cross-reference.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos Cross-Reference Rule i no soim, ples antap na daun\n"
"bai ol i kaunim yet olsem Space Above\n"
"wantaim Space Below bilong rule (we i no stap)."

#: temp.glade:24864
msgid "Space Separating\n"
"Text From xRefs:"
msgstr "Hap Bilong Brukim\n"
"Tekst long ol xRefs:"

#: temp.glade:24877
msgid "The vertical space between the main\n"
"text body and the cross-reference rule.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Ples antap na daun namel long bikpela\n"
"body tok na cross-reference rule.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: temp.glade:24902
msgid "This is the vertical space/gap (pts) between\n"
"the rule and the cross-references.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Dispela em ples antap na daun (pts) namel long\n"
"rule na ol cross-reference.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: temp.glade:24955
msgid "Distance (mm) to move the rule in from the side\n"
"chosen in Horizontal Position.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Longpela (mm) bilong pusim rule i kam insait\n"
"long sait yu makim long Horizontal Position.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: temp.glade:24979
msgid "The length of the rule as a percentage\n"
"of the column/page width.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Longpela bilong rule olsem pesentis\n"
"bilong bikpela bilong kolum/pes.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: temp.glade:25004
msgid "The thickness of the rule.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Tiknes bilong rule.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: temp.glade:25030
msgid "Which side of the column the rule is aligned to:\n"
"Left, Right, Center, Inner (spine side) or Outer.\n"
"Inner and Outer swap sides on odd and even pages.\n"
"This only matters when the Length is less than 100%.\n"
"(Used only when footnotes or cross-references are\n"
"placed at the End of Book. Otherwise the Footnote\n"
"rule settings apply.)"
msgstr "Rule i stap long wanem sait bilong kolum:\n"
"Left, Right, Center, Inner (sait bilong spine) o Outer.\n"
"Inner na Outer i senisim sait long ol odd na even pes.\n"
"Dispela i wok tasol taim Length i liklik long 100%.\n"
"(I wok tasol taim ol futnot o cross-reference i stap\n"
"long End of Book. Sapos nogat, ol Footnote\n"
"rule seting i wok.)"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:3051
msgid "Cross-References"
msgstr "Ol Kros-Refrens"

#: temp.glade:25277
msgid "PTXprint will attempt to balance the number\n"
"of lines in each column of the extended notes. Sometimes this results in wasted empty space.\n"
"Increasing this number (recommended\n"
"range 1-4) will allow up to that many\n"
"unbalanced lines in the extended notes area."
msgstr "PTXprint bai traim long mekim ol lain i sem namba\n"
"long olgeta kolum bilong ol extended nots. Sampela taim dispela i mekim hap i stap nating.\n"
"Sapos yu mekim namba i bikpela (gutpela\n"
"renj em 1-4), bai i larim inap long dispela namba\n"
"bilong ol lain i no sem long hap bilong ol extended nots."

#: temp.glade:25298
msgid "By default (when this is set to 0)\n"
"PTXprint will balance the number of\n"
"lines used in each column. Sometimes\n"
"this results in large empty spaces at the\n"
"end of a page.\n"
"\n"
"Increasing this number (recommended\n"
"range 1-4) will allow up to that many\n"
"unbalanced lines on the page. Note that\n"
"you can still stretch/shrink paragraphs\n"
"using AdjLists to refine the output by\n"
"manually balancing pages."
msgstr "Olsem stret (taim em i stap 0)\n"
"PTXprint bai i meknait long namba bilong\n"
"lain i stap long wanwan kolom. Sampela taim\n"
"dispela i mekim ol bikpela spes nating i stap\n"
"long As bilong pes.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu mekim namba i go antap (gutpela\n"
"namba em 1-4), bai i ken gat hamas lain\n"
"bilong dispela namba i no wankain long pes. Tingim\n"
"tu olsem yu ken pulim/skrinim ol paragraf\n"
"long AdjLists bilong stretim pes long han."

#: temp.glade:25311
msgid "Unbalanced\n"
"Lines (max):"
msgstr "Ol Lain i No\n"
"Wankain (tasol):"

#: temp.glade:25325 temp.glade:25349
msgid "This setting (pts) lets you adjust the vertical\n"
"space between extended footnotes. Usually\n"
"there is no space between them."
msgstr "Dispela seting (pts) i larim yu senisim\n"
"spes i go daun namel long ol extended\n"
"futnot. Olgeta taim i no gat spes namel\n"
"long ol."

#: temp.glade:25353
msgid "Vertical Space\n"
"Between Notes:"
msgstr "Spes i Go Daun\n"
"Namel long Ol Not:"

#: temp.glade:25387
msgid "This setting raises (using a negative value) or \n"
"lowers (using a positive value) the starting \n"
"point of the vertical rule between columns."
msgstr "Dispela seting i litimapim (long negativ\n"
"valyu) o daunim (long positiv valyu) ples\n"
"bilong stat bilong rul i go daun namel\n"
"long ol kolom."

#: temp.glade:25403
msgid "This setting raises (using a negative value) or\n"
"lowers (using a positive value) the starting\n"
"point of the vertical rule between columns (pt)."
msgstr "Dispela seting i litimapim (long yusim negatif namba) o\n"
"pasim daun (long yusim positif namba) ples\n"
"i stat bilong vertikal rule namel long ol kolum (pt)."

#: temp.glade:25439
msgid "Show Note Callers"
msgstr "Soim Ol Kola bilong Not"

#: temp.glade:25444
msgid "Show callers for extended (study) notes, both in\n"
"the text and in the notes area. A caller alerts the\n"
"reader that there is further information (in this\n"
"case an extended footnote) at the end of the page.\n"
"As a Study Bible has many such notes, this option\n"
"is normally turned off for extended footnotes.\n"
"Note that currently only a,b,c...x,y,z callers are\n"
"possible for this option."
msgstr "Soim ol caller bilong ol longpela nots (study nots), long tekst na long hap bilong ol nots. Wanpela caller i makim long ritim man olsem i gat narapela save (long dispela taim, wanpela longpela futnot) long las bilong pes.\n"
"Bilong wanpela Study Baibel i gat planti nots olsem, dispela opsen i save stap ofa long ol longpela futnot.\n"
"Save: nau ol caller a,b,c...x,y,z tasol i ken wok long dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:25705
msgid "Show Study Note Rule"
msgstr "Soim Rul bilong Study Not"

#: temp.glade:25710
msgid "This is the horizontal rule separating\n"
"the body text from the study notes area."
msgstr "Dispela em horizontal rule i brukim tekst bilong buk na hap bilong ol study nots."

#: temp.glade:25761
msgid "The vertical space between the body text and the\n"
"area containing study notes.\n"
"\n"
"If the Study Note Rule is not shown, the vertical\n"
"space will still be calculated as the Space Above\n"
"plus the Space Below (the imaginary) Rule."
msgstr "Spes antap na daun namel long tekst bilong buk na hap bilong ol study nots.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos Study Note Rule i no soim, spes i save kisim yet olsem Space Above plus Space Below bilong rule (dispela rule i no stap tru)."

#: temp.glade:25781
msgid "The vertical space between the main\n"
"text body and the study note rule.\n"
"\n"
"Note: if you make this value less than the descenders\n"
"of the last lines of text, then the study notes will push\n"
"down into the footer area. If you see this happening,\n"
"increase this value to trigger an earlier page break to\n"
"solve the problem."
msgstr "Spes antap na daun namel long tekst bilong buk na study note rule.\n"
"\n"
"Save: sapos yu mekim dispela namba i liklik moa long ol descender bilong las lain bilong tekst, orait ol study nots i bai pushim i go daun long hap bilong footer. Sapos yu lukim olsem, putim bikpela namba long mekim pes i brek moa paslain na rausim dispela hevi."

#: temp.glade:25809
msgid "This is the vertical space/gap (pts) between\n"
"the rule and the study notes."
msgstr "Dispela em spes (pts) antap na daun namel long rule na ol study nots."

#: temp.glade:25850
msgid "Extended Footnotes (\\ef)"
msgstr "Extended Futnot (\\ef)"

#: temp.glade:25855
msgid "Extended Footnotes are the primary means for\n"
"displaying study notes. These are similar to \n"
"ordinary footnotes but appear as a 2-column\n"
"block at the end of each page. "
msgstr "Extended Futnot em i namba wan rot bilong\n"
"soim ol study not. Ol i olsem ol futnot\n"
"bilong olgeta taim, tasol ol i kamap olsem\n"
"wanpela blok bilong 2 kolom long as bilong\n"
"wanwan pes. "

#: temp.glade:25876
msgid "Sidebars (\\esb ... \\esbe)"
msgstr "Saidbar (\\esb ... \\esbe)"

#: temp.glade:25881
msgid "Sidebars (\\esb ... \\esbe) are used to contain \n"
"larger blocks of topic-specific information. "
msgstr "Ol Saidbar (\\esb ... \\esbe) i holim ol\n"
"bikpela blok bilong infomesen long wanpela\n"
"topik. "

#: temp.glade:25918 temp.glade:25936
msgid "Enter the language code for the questions\n"
"to be included. Usually this will be a 3-letter\n"
"Ethnologue code (but other language tags\n"
"such as en-US, fr, es are also acceptable)."
msgstr "Putim kod bilong tokples bilong ol askim\n"
"bai yu laik putim. Planti taim em i 3-leta\n"
"kod bilong Ethnologue (tasol ol narapela\n"
"tag bilong tokples olsem en-US, fr, es i orait tu)."

#: temp.glade:25941
msgid "Language Code:"
msgstr "Kod bilong Tokples:"

#: temp.glade:25962
msgid "Show Overview Questions"
msgstr "Soim Ol Askim bilong Overview"

#: temp.glade:25967
msgid "Overview questions are designed to test\n"
"the general understanding of the passage."
msgstr "Ol askim bilong overview i stap bilong\n"
"makim sapos man i save long olgeta tok\n"
"bilong dispela hap."

#: temp.glade:25983
msgid "Number the Questions"
msgstr "Putim Namba long Ol Askim"

#: temp.glade:25988
msgid "This option enables the questions to be\n"
"numbered sequentially for each book."
msgstr "Dispela seting i larim ol askim i kisim\n"
"namba i go long rot bilong wanwan buk."

#: temp.glade:26005
msgid "Include Chapter:Verse References"
msgstr "Putim Ol Kapitel:Ves Namba"

#: temp.glade:26010
msgid "This option enables the questions to\n"
"include the chapter:verse numbers.\n"
"\n"
"If the questions are also being numbered\n"
"then the reference will be shown in parentheses (ch:vs)."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i larim ol kwestin i putim ol namba bilong kapitel:ves.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos ol kwestin i garim namba tu, orait ol i bai soim ol refrens insait long kolam (ch:vs)."

#: temp.glade:26033
msgid "Example Questions:"
msgstr "Ol Eksampel Askim:"

#: temp.glade:26059
msgid "13. (3:25) What does it means to bless someone?\n"
"14. (4:6) What do you know about the high priest?"
msgstr "13. (3:25) Wanem as bilong blesim wanpela man?\n"
"14. (4:6) Yu save long wanem long het pris?"

#: temp.glade:26077
msgid "Click to edit the Extended Footnote\n"
"properties on the Styles tab. \n"
"\n"
"The line spacing factor will modify\n"
"the space between the questions."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol propeti bilong\n"
"Extended Futnot long Styles tab.\n"
"\n"
"Spes namel long ol lain bai i senisim\n"
"spes namel long ol askim."

#: temp.glade:26106
msgid "Include Transcelerator Questions"
msgstr "Putim Ol Askim bilong Transcelerator"

#: temp.glade:26111
msgid "Use this option to include questions which\n"
"have been created with SIL's Transcelerator\n"
"tool for the purpose of comprehension testing.\n"
"\n"
"These will be displayed at the bottom of the page\n"
"in the area normally used for Study Notes.\n"
"\n"
"Note that this option is only made available if\n"
"the Transcelerator plugin's data folder for the\n"
"project can be located."
msgstr "Yusim dispela seting long putim ol askim\n"
"i kamap long tul bilong SIL, Transcelerator,\n"
"bilong traim save bilong man.\n"
"\n"
"Ol i bai kamap long as bilong pes, long\n"
"hap olgeta taim bilong Study Not.\n"
"\n"
