#: temp.glade:26904
msgid "Chapter"
msgstr "Kapitel"

#: temp.glade:26908
msgid "By default, the chapter number will be included\n"
"in any references in the header line. If you prefer\n"
"to suppress that (and just show the book name)\n"
"then uncheck this option. (Verse numbers can\n"
"only be shown if Chapter is ticked.)"
msgstr "Olgeta taim, namba bilong kapitel i stap insait long ol refrens long header lain. Sapos yu no laik, na yu laik soim nem bilong buk tasol, orait rausim mak long dispela opsen. (Ol namba bilong ves i ken soim sapos Chapter i gat mak.)"

#: temp.glade:26929
msgid "Verse"
msgstr "Ves"

#: temp.glade:26933
msgid "By default only the Book and Chapter number\n"
"is included in the Header. If you also want to\n"
"include the verse numbers, then check this option.\n"
"\n"
"Keep in mind that including the verse numbers\n"
"actually makes it harder to read/absorb when\n"
"flicking through pages to find the right chapter."
msgstr "Olsem stret, nem bilong buk na namba bilong kapitel tasol i stap long Header. Sapos yu laik putim namba bilong ves tu, makim dispela opsen.\n"
"\n"
"Haitim olsem, sapos namba bilong ves i stap, i hatwok moa long ritim na painim stret kapitel taim yu tanim ol pes."

#: temp.glade:26959
msgid "Colon (ch:vs)"
msgstr "Kolon (kap:ves)"

#: temp.glade:26963
msgid "Use a colon (:) to separate\n"
"chapter & verse numbers\n"
"in the header reference."
msgstr "Usim kolon (:) long brukim\n"
"namba bilong kapitel na ves\n"
"long refrens bilong header."

#: temp.glade:26981
msgid "Period (ch.vs)"
msgstr "Poin (kap.ves)"

#: temp.glade:26985
msgid "Use a period (.) to separate\n"
"chapter & verse numbers\n"
"in the header reference."
msgstr "Usim poin (.) long brukim\n"
"namba bilong kapitel na ves\n"
"long refrens bilong header."

#: temp.glade:27011
msgid "Include in References:"
msgstr "Putim long ol Refrens:"

#: temp.glade:27020
msgid "Book"
msgstr "Buk"

#: temp.glade:27024
msgid "By default, the book name will be included\n"
"in any references in the header line. But if you\n"
"wish to suppress that (and just show the \n"
"chapter and/or verse numbers) then \n"
"uncheck this option."
msgstr "Olsem stret, nem bilong buk i stap long olgeta\n"
"refrens long header. Sapos yu no laik\n"
"sapos (na laik soim namba bilong kapitel\n"
"na/o ves tasol), rausim mak long dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:27046
msgid "Chapter-Verse Separator:"
msgstr "Mak i Brukim Kapitel na Ves:"

#: temp.glade:27126
msgid "If the document you are creating needs\n"
"to be appended to another, you can\n"
"start the page numbering from where\n"
"the previous document ends by entering\n"
"the subsequent page number here."
msgstr "Sapos dokumen yu wokim i mas i go bihain long narapela, yu ken stat long namba bilong pes we pastaim dokumen i pinis, taipim namba bilong pes i kam bihain long hia."

#: temp.glade:27132
msgid "Starting Page Number\n"
"(for Scripture Books):"
msgstr "Namba bilong Pes i Stat\n"
"(bilong ol Buk bilong Skripsa):"

#: temp.glade:27145
msgid "If the document you are creating needs\n"
"to be appended to another, you can\n"
"start the page numbering from where\n"
"the previous document ends by entering\n"
"the subsequent page number here. (If the front\n"
"matter already uses normal page numbers, the\n"
"numbering just continues instead.)"
msgstr "Sapos dokumen yu wokim i mas i go bihain long narapela, yu ken stat long namba bilong pes we pastaim dokumen i pinis, taipim namba bilong pes i kam bihain long hia. (Sapos front matter i yusim pinis ol nomol namba bilong pes, ol namba i go het tasol.)"

#: temp.glade:27172
msgid "Print Page Number at Bottom of Intro Page(s)"
msgstr "Sapos dokumen yu wokim i mas i go bihain long narapela, yu ken stat long namba bilong pes i kamap bihain long pinis bilong paslain dokumen. Putim dispela namba bilong pes long hia."

#: temp.glade:27177
msgid "Print the page number at the bottom of the\n"
"first page of each book (the title page,\n"
"where the header is not shown).\n"
"\n"
"This cannot be used together with 'Print Name\n"
"of Saved Config on Intro Page(s)'."
msgstr "Printim namba bilong pes long daun bilong namba wan pes bilong olgeta buk (title pes, we header i no soim).\n"
"\n"
"Dispela i no inap wok wantaim 'Print Name of Saved Config on Intro Page(s)'."

#: temp.glade:27195
msgid "Print Name of Saved Config on Intro Page(s)"
msgstr "Printim Namba bilong Pes long Daunbilo bilong Pes Introdaksen"

#: temp.glade:27200
msgid "It may be helpful to print the Name of\n"
"the Saved Configuration on the first\n"
"page (of every book) as a reminder for\n"
"later - as to which settings were used\n"
"to produce the PDF.\n"
"\n"
"This cannot be used together with 'Print Page\n"
"Number at Bottom of Intro Page(s)'."
msgstr "Maski i gutpela long printim Nem bilong Saved Configuration long namba wan pes (bilong olgeta buk) bilong tingim bihain, ol seting i wok long wokim PDF.\n"
"\n"
"Dispela i no inap wok wantaim 'Print Page Number at Bottom of Intro Page(s)'."

#: temp.glade:27270
msgid "It is not considered best-practice to include \n"
"information in a footer for scripture publications.\n"
"This is usually better placed in the header. However,\n"
"if there is a need to have the page number at the\n"
"footer for all pages (not just the 1st page of each book)\n"
"then that can be set here. Similarly, you may want to add\n"
"a DRAFT message and/or date to the end of each page.\n"
"Note that you can select a preset option OR type your own\n"
"text as needed.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"[\\pagenumber]   places square brackets around the page number\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins   would give \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     places nothing in that location\n"
"\n"
"Note that if you really must have Inner/Outer Footers,\n"
"these can be set in the ptxprint-mods.tex file."
msgstr "I no gutpela tumas long putim infomesen long footer bilong ol buk bilong Skripsa. Planti taim i gutpela moa long putim long header. Tasol sapos yu nidim namba bilong pes long footer bilong olgeta pes (i no namba wan pes bilong buk tasol), yu ken seting hia. Olsem tu, yu ken putim DRAFT mesis na/o dei long las bilong olgeta pes.\n"
"Save: yu ken makim wanpela preset opsen O taipim tekst bilong yu yet.\n"
"\n"
"Bilong eksampel:\n"
"[\\pagenumber]   i putim square brekets raun long namba bilong pes\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins   i givim \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     i no putim wanpela samting long dispela hap\n"
"\n"
"Save: sapos yu nidim tru Inner/Outer Footers, yu ken seting ol long ptxprint-mods.tex file."

#: temp.glade:27297
msgid "DRAFT"
msgstr "DRAFT"

#: temp.glade:27323
msgid "It is not considered best-practice to include \n"
"information in a footer for scripture publications.\n"
"This is usually better placed in the header. However,\n"
"if there is a need to have the page number at the\n"
"footer for all pages (not just the 1st page of each book)\n"
"then that can be set here. Similarly, you may want to add\n"
"a DRAFT message and/or date to the end of each page.\n"
"Note that you can select a preset option OR type your own\n"
"text as needed.\n"
"Note that if you really must have Inner/Outer Footers,\n"
"these can be set in the ptxprint-mods.tex file."
msgstr "Ol i no tingim olsem gutpela pasin long putim infomesen long footer bilong ol Skripsa pablikesen. Long header i gutpela moa. Tasol sapos yu laik putim namba bilong pes long footer bilong olgeta pes (i no namba wan pes bilong buk tasol), yu ken seting long hia. Yu ken putim tu DRAFT o de long las bilong olgeta pes.\n"
"Yu ken makim wanpela preset o raitim tekst bilong yu yet.\n"
"Sapos yu mas gat Inner/Outer Footer, yu ken seting long fail ptxprint-mods.tex."

#: temp.glade:27335
msgid "Center Footer:"
msgstr "Footer long Namel:"

