"you will need to specify whether\n"
"this part of the footer (its text and\n"
"formatting) should come from the Primary\n"
"(Left) or the Secondary text."
msgstr "Sapos yu seting footer bilong wanpela diglot, yu mas makim sapos dispela hap bilong footer (tekst na fomat bilong en) i mas kam long Primary (Left) o long Secondary tekst."

