msgstr "Kamapim..."

#: temp.glade:27716
msgid "This button will (re-)generate the PicList\n"
"from the USFM \\fig ... \\fig* definitions.\n"
"\n"
"If you just want to (re-)generate the PicList\n"
"for a single book, then select that book on\n"
"the Basic tab."
msgstr "Dispela boton bai kamapim (o kamapim gen) PicList\n"
"stap long ol USFM \\fig ... \\fig* definisen.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik kamapim (o kamapim gen) PicList\n"
"bilong wanpela buk tasol, orait makim dispela buk\n"
"long Basic tab."

#: temp.glade:27736
msgid "Click to add another picture to the PicList. You\n"
"will need to fill in all the details in the area below."
msgstr "Klikim long putim narapela pikja i go long PicList. Yu\n"
"mas pulim olgeta displa long hap i stap daunbilo."

#: temp.glade:27749
msgid "Refresh List"
msgstr "Nupela Lista"

#: temp.glade:27754
msgid "Refresh Captions:\n"
"If you have edited the picture captions\n"
"within the Paratext USFM files but those\n"
"changes are not being reflected here, \n"
"then click this button to refresh the captions.\n"
"\n"
"Note that only the Captions and Verse Refs\n"
"will be updated. All other size and position\n"
"settings will remain unchanged."
msgstr "Nupelaim Kepsen:\n"
"Sapos yu senisim ol kepsen bilong pikja\n"
"long ol Paratext USFM fail tasol ol senis\n"
"i no kamap long hia,\n"
"orait klikim dispela boton long nupelaim ol kepsen.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim, ol Kepsen na ol Ves Ref tasol\n"
"bai i kisim nupela. Olgeta seting bilong bikpela\n"
"na ples bilong pikja bai i stap olsem."

#: temp.glade:27772 temp.glade:37355
msgid "Add Maps..."
msgstr "Putim Map..."

#: temp.glade:27777 temp.glade:37360
