"can be added to one of the XX* books\n"
"or to the XXM book using this dialog."
msgstr "Yu ken putim ol map long las bilong buk\n"
"i go long wanpela bilong ol XX* buk\n"
"o long XXM buk, long dispela dialog."

#: temp.glade:27791
