#: temp.glade:33828 temp.glade:33871
msgid "How much of the column-width can be\n"
"empty space at a non-justified edge? This\n"
"affects mid-paragraph line-breaking and \n"
"may cause stretching of other spacing if \n"
"the line would be too short otherwise. It \n"
"does not stop the final line of a paragraph\n"
"from being shorter.\n"
"\n"
"This value is set as the proportion of the\n"
"column width, with sensible values being\n"
"with the range of 0.20 to 0.75 (where 1.00\n"
"represents the entire column width).\n"
"Discretionary breaks (//) will be ignored if \n"
"breaking there would leave more than this \n"
"much space."
msgstr "Hamas bilong bikpela bilong kolum inap stap spes nating long sait i no justify? Dispela i senisim brekim lain namel long paragraf, na i ken bikim narapela spes sapos lain i sot tumas. Dispela i no stopim las lain bilong paragraf long sot.\n"
"\n"
"Ol i makim dispela value olsem hap bilong bikpela bilong kolum, na gutpela value i stap namel long 0.20 na 0.75 (1.00 em olgeta bikpela bilong kolum).\n"
"Ol discretionary break (//) bai ol i no lukim sapos brekim long hap i bin lusim spes i bikpela moa long dispela."

